<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Marika Suran</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marika</para>
  <para style="toc2">MAR</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Marika ka Isa la Ko Kibaro Ɲuma Mɛn Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa kɔfɛbilailu naanin de ka Maari Isa la tariku ni a la kumailu sɛbɛ Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ: Matiyu, Marika, Luka, a ni Yuhana. Mɔɔilu lani a la ko Marika ka wo sɛbɛ kosa Romukailu ri lemɛniya Isa ma. A koilu ɲafɔni ɲa do rɔ kosa Romukailu ri la Isa la fanka la. Isa ka kabannako ko mɛnilu kɛ, woilu le ɲafɔni ka tamin Isa karan kan Marika ta kan dɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marika ka Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin sɛbɛ ten san bisawa (30) tamin Isa nayɛlɛ kɔrɔ sankolo rɔ. Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin Isa ye sun ko le fɔlɔ ji rɔ. A tɛ a sɔrɔn ko ɲafɔla. Isa la dunuɲaratɛɛ rɔ, a ka karan siyaman fɔ le a la jama yɛ. A ka kabannako ko siyaman kɛ ten. Marika ye wo le ɲafɔla Isa ma. Tɔɔ la, a ka Isa la saya ɲafɔ a ni a lawuli ko saya rɔ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yuhana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔɔ ye Yuhana ɲin tɔɔla fanan ko Yaya.</char></note> mɛn ye mɔɔ sunna ji rɔ ka kawandili kɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ragbɛ Matiyu suran 3 kuma diya 1 haan 12, Luka suran 3 kuma diya 1 haan 18, Yuhana suran 1 kuma diya 19 haan 28</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Kibaro ɲuma mɛn ye Alla Dencɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko fɔla, wo damira le ɲin di. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Awa, a sɛbɛnin Esayi la kitabu kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nde Alla, n di n na keladen nawa i ɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">mɛn di sila rabɛn i yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Cɛɛ do ye a kan ba labɔla wula kɔndɔ ka a fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Ai ye sila rabɛn Maari yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">ka silailu latelen a yɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Nba, Yaya wulira mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ wula kɔndɔ. A tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu kawandila ka ii lalɔnnin ko ii ka kan ka ii kɔnkɔ don ii hakɛilu la ka sun ji rɔ, sa Alla ri ii la hakɛilu makoto.<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Mɔɔ siyaman ba tɛrɛ ye bɔla Jude mara rɔ, a ni Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ, ka wa Yaya kɔfɛ. Ii wa ii lɔ ii la hakɛilu la, Yaya ri ii sun ji rɔ Juridɛn Ba rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Durukiba mɛn tɛrɛ Yaya kan na, wo tɛrɛ ɲɔɔmɛ si le ri. A tɛsidinin tɛrɛ gbolojulu la. A tɛrɛ tonkasailu ni waa rɔ li le dɔɔnna. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />A tɛrɛ mɔɔilu kawandila ko: «Mɔɔ mɛn natɔ n kɔ, wo fanka ka bon n ta ri. Hali ka n birin ka a la sanbara julu fulen a yɛ, wo ka bon nde ma. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />N di ai sun ji rɔ, kɔni ale ri ai sun Alla Nii Sɛniman dɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya ka Isa sun ji rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Wo waati rɔ, Isa nara ka bɔ Nasarɛti so kɔndɔ, mɛn ye Kalile mara rɔ. Yaya ka a sun ji rɔ Juridɛn Ba rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Isa bɔtɔla ji rɔ, a ka sankolo da lakanin yen, ka Alla Nii Sɛniman fanan jiitɔla yen a kan ikomin kanba. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kumakan do bɔra sankolo rɔ ko: «I ye n diyanan dencɛ le ri. I la ko duman ba le n yɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Awa, Alla Nii Sɛniman ka Isa lawa wula kɔndɔ i kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />A ka tele binaanin (40) kɛ wula kɔndɔ, Setana ye a kɔrɔbɔla. Waarɔ soboilu fanan tɛrɛ ye ye. Mɛlɛkailu tɛrɛ a mako ɲala.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔ naanin kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Nba, Yaya bila kɔ kaso la, Isa wara Kalile mara rɔ ka kibaro ɲuma lase mɔɔilu ma, kibaro ɲuma mɛn faranin Alla la. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />A tɛrɛ a fɔla mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Alla ka waati mɛn natɛɛ, wo ra se. Alla la mansaya ra madon ai la. Wo le kosɔn, ai ye tubi ai hakɛilu ma, ka la kibaro ɲuma la.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Lon do rɔ, Isa tɛrɛ taamanna Kalile Dala dafɛ. A ka Simɔn a ni a dɔɔcɛ Andere yen. Ii tɛrɛ ye jɛɛmira jɔɔ lafilila dala kan ji rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn ii tɛrɛ sɔmɔnɔ le ri. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye na ai bila n kɔfɛ. N di ai karan mɔɔ ɲininna ka a lana Alla ma ikomin ai ye jɛɛ sɔmɔnna ɲa mɛn ma.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ii ka ii la jɔɔilu to ye ka ii bila Isa kɔfɛ i kɔrɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Isa taminnin yɔrɔ wo la dɔɔnin, a ka Yakuba ni a dɔɔcɛ Yuhana yen, mɛn tɛrɛ Sebede dencɛilu ri. Ii siinin tɛrɛ ii la jɔɔilu rabɛnna ii la kulun kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Isa ka ii kili i kɔrɔ. Ii ka ii fa ni baaradenilu to kulun kɔndɔ ka ii bila Isa kɔfɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jena gbɛn ka a bɔ cɛɛ do fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ni a la karandenilu wara Kapɛrinahumu so kɔndɔ. Ɲɔɲɔ Lon senin, Isa donda salibon na ka mɔɔilu karan. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />A la karanɲa ka mɔɔilu kabannakoya, baa a ka ii karan ikomin se ye mɛn bolo. A ma ii karan ikomin sariya karanmɔɔilu ye ii karanna ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Wo waati jɛrɛ rɔ, cɛɛ jenatɔlamɔ do wulira salibon kɔndɔ ka a kɛ kule ri ko: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Ɛɛ, Isa Nasarɛtika! I ye nfen kɔ an tɛma yan? I nanin an halaki kan de ma wa? I ye mɔɔ mɛn di, n ka wo lɔn: Alla la Mɔɔ Sɛniman de i ri.» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Isa jamanda jena ma ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I makun! Bɔ cɛɛ wo fɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Jena ka cɛɛ wo layɛrɛyɛrɛ kojuuya, ka kule ba kɛ, ka bɔ a fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ kabannakoyara fɔɔ ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Nfen de ɲin di? Karan kura le, se ye mɛn yɛ. A ye jamarili dila hali jenailu ma. A wa mɛn fɔ ii yɛ, ii ye wo labatola.» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Isa tɔɔ bɔra Kalile mara yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ jonna.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jankarɔtɔ siyaman nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ni a la karandenilu bɔra salibon kɔndɔ ka wa Simɔn ni Andere wara. Yakuba ni Yuhana tɛrɛ ye ii malɔla. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Simɔn biranmuso lanin tɛrɛ, farikalaya ye a la. Ii ka a ko fɔ Isa yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Isa ka a madon a la, ka a mira a bolo ma ka a lawuli. Farimakaliya ka a bila. A wulira ka dɔɔnnin di ii ma.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1.32 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɲɔɲɔ Lon da ban tele be tuma, sisɛn mɔɔ bɛɛ ri se nala Isa ma ka ii lakɛndɛya</char>
    </note>Nba, wura dafɛ, tele be kɔrɔ, so mɔɔilu nara jankarɔtɔilu ri Isa tɔrɔfɛ, a ni jenatɔla mɔɔilu bɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />So kɔndɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka ii ladɛn bonda la. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Isa ka jankarɔtɔ siyaman nakɛndɛya mɛn tɛ jankarɔ su kelen di. A ka jenailu gbɛn mɔɔ siyaman fɛ fanan. Kɔni a ma sɔn jena woilu ye kuma, baa ii ka a lɔn a ye mɔɔ mɛn di.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔilu kawandi Kalile mara rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Nba, wo lon duu sa gbɛ sɔɔma da la jonna, ka a tɛrɛn kɛnɛ ma bɔ fɔlɔ, Isa wulira. A bɔra bon na ka wa Alla matara diya wula kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simɔn ni a duɲɔɔilu wara Isa ɲinin diya. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ii ka a yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ bɛɛ ye i diya ɲininna.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Isa ka ii jabi: «An ye bɔ yan ka wa yan naminin soilu la, sa n di ye mɔɔilu fanan kawandi. Baa n nanin wo le kanma.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Wo rɔ a wara Kalile mara fan bɛɛ rɔ. A ka mɔɔilu kawandi salibonilu kɔndɔ, ka jenailu gbɛn ka ii bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ fanan.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka kunatɔ do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Lon do rɔ, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kunatɔ bɛɛ tɛrɛ latonin de, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ti sela ii ma</char></note>kunatɔ do nara ka a ɲɔnkin Isa kɔrɔ, ka a madiya ko: «Ni a duman i yɛ, i ri se n nadahala.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Cɛɛ kininkinin donda Isa rɔ. Isa ka a bolo maa a la ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N da sɔn. I ye daha.» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Kuna ka cɛɛ wo bila i kɔrɔkɔrɔ. A dahara. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43-44" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya ko: «I ye a kɛ koɲuma, i kana wo ko fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ. Wa, Alla la sarakalasela ye i mafɛnɛ. Wo wa ban, Musa ka saraka mɛn fɔ, i ye wo bɔ ka a yiraka bɛɛ la ko i ra kɛndɛya.» Wo fɔ kɔ rɔ, Isa ka sila di cɛɛ ma i kɔrɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Cɛɛ bɔra ye ka wa. Kɔni ko mɛn kɛra a yɛ, a ka wo lakali damira fan bɛɛ rɔ. Wo le ka a kɛ, Isa ma se donna so gbɛrɛ si kɔndɔ butun. A tɛrɛ tola wula le kɔndɔ. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye bɔla fan bɛɛ rɔ ka wa a tɛrɛn ye.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Tele dɔndɔ taminnin kɔ, Isa nara Kapɛrinahumu so kɔndɔ ikɔ tuun. Mɔɔilu ka a mɛn ko a ye bon na ye. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ii siyaman nara ii ladɛn bon na fɔɔ lɔdiya ma sɔrɔn butun hali bonda la ye. Isa tɛrɛ ye Alla la kuma lasela ii ma. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ka a to wo la, mɔɔ doilu nara cɛɛ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ wo tɔrɔfɛ. Mɔɔ naanin de ka a ta. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ii ma se ii madonna Isa la jama bolo. Wo rɔ, ii yɛlɛra bon kun bilinin kan ka wo do bɔ Isa sii diya san ma, ka ban ka cɛɛ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ ni a lafen najii woo wo la. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Isa ka ii la lemɛniya yen tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ yɛ ko: «N dencɛ, i hakɛilu ra makoto.»<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wo ka sariya karanmɔɔ doilu siinin tɛrɛn ye. Woilu ka a fɔ ii jɛrɛ kɔndɔ ko: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Nfenna cɛɛ ɲin ye kumala ten? A ra Alla tanama kuma fɔ! Yon di se hakɛilu makotola ni Alla kelen tɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Isa ka ii miriya lɔn a jɛrɛ ma i kɔrɔ. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye ai mirila ten? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />A ye di? Ka a fɔ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ yɛ ko: ‹I hakɛilu ra makoto›, wala: ‹I ye wuli ka i la lafen ta ka i taama›, wo fila rɔ ɲuman fɔ nɔman? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Nba, n di a yiraka ai la ko a se ye nde Mɔɔ Dencɛ yɛ ka hakɛilu makoto dunuɲa rɔ yan.» Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ yɛ ko: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«N ye a fɔ i yɛ ko: ‹I wuli ka i la lafen ta ka wa i wara.›»<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Cɛɛ wo wulira ka a la lafen ta i kɔrɔ ka bɔ kɛnɛma mɔɔilu bɛɛ ɲana. Ii bɛɛ kabannakoyara ka a kɛ Alla tando ri ko: «An tun ma ɲin ɲɔɔn yen fɔlɔ fewu!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Lebi kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Awa, Isa ka a kɔsɛ dala da la. Jama ba nara a tɛrɛn ye. A ka ii karan. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Awa, a tamintɔla, a ka cɛɛ do siinin yen <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Judiyailu ka niisɔnkɔmiralailu kɔn</char></note>niisɔnkɔ mira diya. Alife dencɛ Lebi le wo ri. Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye bila n kɔfɛ.» A wulira ka a bila Isa kɔfɛ.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa wara dɔɔnnin diya Lebi wara. Niisɔnkɔmirala siyaman ni kojuukɛla siyaman siinin tɛrɛ dɔɔnnin kɛla Isa ni a la karandenilu dafɛ, baa woilu siyaman bilanin tɛrɛ Isa kɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Sariya karanmɔɔ doilu tɛrɛ ye ye, mɛnilu tɛrɛ Farisiilu ri. Woilu ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko Isa ye dɔɔnnin kɛla niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni kojuukɛlailu dafɛ, ii ka Isa la karandenilu maɲininka ko: «Nfenna ai la karanmɔɔ ye dɔɔnnin kɛla niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni kojuukɛlailu dafɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Isa ka mɔɔ woilu la kuma mɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ mɛnilu kɛndɛ, woilu mako tɛ dandalila la. Jankarɔtɔilu le mako ye dandalila la. N ma na telenbailu kili kanma. N nanin kojuukɛlailu le kili kanma.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɛn fɔ sun na ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Nba, lon do rɔ, ka Yaya la karandenilu ni Farisiilu la karandenilu to sun dɔ, mɔɔ doilu nara Isa tɛrɛn ye ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfenna Yaya la karandenilu ni Farisiilu la karandenilu ye sun donna, kɔni ile la karandenilu tɛ wo kɛla?»<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Isa ka ii jabi: «A ye di? Ka kɔɲɔcɛ to a teriilu dafɛ kɔɲɔmalɔ rɔ, kɔɲɔcɛ teriilu ri se sun donna wa? Ka kɔɲɔcɛ to ii dafɛ, ii ti se sun donna. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kɔni lon do natɔ, mɔɔilu ri kɔɲɔcɛ bɔ ii tɛma. Wo lon, ii ri sun don.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Mɔɔ tɛ faanin kura kunkundun ta ka faanin kɔrɔ labadi. Ni mɔɔ ka wo kɛ, faanin kura ri faanin kɔrɔ sɔmɔn ka a fara. A faraɲa wo ri juuya ka tamin fɔlɔmanta la. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Mɔɔ tɛ rɛsɛnji kura kɛla foroko kɔrɔ kɔndɔ. Ni mɔɔ ka wo kɛ, rɛsɛnji kura ri jidi ka kanka, ka foroko kɔrɔ fara. Rɛsɛnji ni foroko bɛɛ ri tiɲan. Ɔɔn, mɔɔ ri rɛsɛnji kura kɛ foroko kura le kɔndɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɛn fɔ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon na ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ɲɔɲɔ Lon do rɔ, Isa ni a la karandenilu tɛrɛ ye taminna sɛnɛ do tɛma. Ii tamintɔla, a la karandenilu ka sɛnɛsuman tɔnsɔn doilu kadi damira. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Farisiilu ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ, nfenna i la karandenilu ye ko wo kɛla Ɲɔɲɔ Lon? Wo dahanin tɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Isa ka ii jabi: «A ye di? Mansa Dawuda ka mɛn kɛ fɔlɔfɔlɔ, ai ma wo karan wa? Kɔnkɔ tɛrɛ a ni a taamaɲɔɔilu la. Fen tun tɛ ii bolo. <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Wo rɔ, Abiyatara tɛrɛ Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiya la waati mɛn na, Dawuda donda Alla la bon kɔndɔ ka buru ta ka a dɔɔn, buru mɛn bilanin Alla yɛ ye. A ka wo do di a taamaɲɔɔilu fanan ma. Kɔni ka a bɛn sariya ma, mɔɔ si ma kan ka buru wo dɔɔn ni Alla la sarakalaselailu tɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ Farisi woilu yɛ ko: «Alla ka Ɲɔɲɔ Lon kɛ mɔɔ munanfan ko le ri. A ma mɔɔ dan Ɲɔɲɔ Lon na. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Wo le rɔ, nde Mɔɔ Dencɛ ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon fanan kuntii le ri.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Lon do rɔ, Isa donda salibon do kɔndɔ. Cɛɛ bolofaanin do tɛrɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mɔɔilu tɛrɛ Isa ragbɛla kosɛbɛ ka a yen ni a ri cɛɛ wo lakɛndɛya Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, baa ii ye sariya sɔrɔn ko rɔ a ma. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Isa ka a fɔ cɛɛ bolofaanin yɛ ko: «I wuli ka i lɔ jama tɛma.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Isa ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «A ye di? A dahanin ka koɲuma kɛ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon wa, wala ka kojuu kɛ, ka mɔɔ kisi wa, wala ka a faa?» Ii ka ii makun. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />A mɔnɛra ka a ɲa lɔ ii rɔ ka ii ragbɛ. A niilafinda ka a masɔrɔn ii ma sɔn a ɲayenna. A ka a fɔ cɛɛ bolofaanin yɛ ko: «I bolo rasɔmɔn.» Cɛɛ ka a bolo rasɔmɔn mɛn kɛ, a bolo kɛndɛyara fewu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Farisiilu bɔra ka wa. Ii ni mansa Herodi kɔmɔɔ doilu ka i ɲɔɔn yen i kɔrɔ ka Isa faa ko ɲa ɲinin.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jama ba wara Isa kɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Isa ni a la karandenilu wara Kalile Dala dala. Jama ba bilara a kɔfɛ ka bɔ Kalile mara rɔ. Mɔɔilu fanan bɔra Jude mara rɔ, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />a ni Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ ka wa a kɔfɛ. Mɔɔilu bɔra Idume mara fanan dɔ, a ni Juridɛn Ba kɔfɛla, a ni Tiri ni Sidɔn soilu fan fɛla. A kɛra jama ba ri. Ii wara Isa kɔfɛ ye, baa a fɔra ii ɲana a ye ko mɛnilu bɛɛ kɛla. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Jama ba kosɔn, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko ii ye kulun do rabɛn a yɛ sa jama kana a ragbɛrɛn. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Baa a tun ka jankarɔtɔilu siyaman nakɛndɛya. Wo rɔ, jankarɔtɔ tɔilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu tuuntuunna sa ii ri ɲa sɔrɔn ka ii maa a la. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Jenailu ka Isa yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka ii be a ɲakɔrɔ ka ii kan nabɔ ko: «Alla Dencɛ le ile ri.» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kɔni Isa ka ii jamari fanka la ko ii kana a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ a ye mɛn di.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔ tan ni fila suwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa yɛlɛra koyinkɛ do kan. Mɛnilu ka a diya, a ka woilu kili. Woilu nara a tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />A ka mɔɔ tan ni fila suwandi ka ii kɛ talibidenbailu ri sa ii ri kɛ a fɛ tuma bɛɛ, a ni sa a ri ii kelaya mɔɔilu kawandi diya. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />A ka jenailu gbɛn se di ii ma fanan. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />A ka mɔɔ tan ni fila mɛnilu kɛ talibidenbailu ri, woilu le ɲin di: a ka Simɔn ta, a tun ka mɛn tɔɔ la ko <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Piyɛri kɔrɔ ye le ko kabakudun</char></note>Piyɛri. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />A ka Sebede dencɛ fila fanan ta, mɛnilu ye Yakuba ni Yuhana ri. A ka woilu tɔɔ la ko Bowanɛrɛ. Wo kɔrɔ le ko ii fadiman ikomin sankulunkan. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />A ka Andere ni Filipe ni Baritɔlɔmi fanan ta, a ni Matiyu ni Tomasi ni Alife dencɛ Yakuba ni Tade ni Simɔn Fabaden. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />A ka Judasi Sikariyɔti fanan ta, mɛn natɔ a donna mɔɔilu bolo.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la fanka ma bɔ Ibulusa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa donda bon do kɔndɔ. Jama ba nara ii ladɛn a dafɛ kokura. Wo rɔ, Isa ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ka dɔɔnnin kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ko wo fɔra Isa la denbaya mɔɔilu yɛ tuma mɛn na, ii wulira ka na ko ii ye a mirala ka wa a ri, baa ii ka a fɔ ko a kunkolo wulini. <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Sariya karanmɔɔ mɛnilu bɔnin Jerusalɛmu ka na, woilu tɛrɛ ye a fɔla ko: «Jenailu kuntii ba Ibulusa le ye a fɛ. Ko Ibulusa le ye fanka dila a ma ka jenailu gbɛn ka bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Wo rɔ, Isa ka ii kili ka kuma kɔrɔlama doilu fɔ ii yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Setana ri Setana gbɛn ɲa ɲuman ma? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ni jamanadenilu wulira i ɲɔɔn kanma, wo jamana ti se sabatila. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ni denbaya mɔɔilu wulira i ɲɔɔn kanma, wo denbaya ti se sabatila. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, ni Setana wulira a jɛrɛ kanma ka a jɛrɛ kɛlɛ, a la fanka ti se sabatila. A bantɔ le.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Ni mɔɔ ye a fɛ ka don cɛɛ fankama la bon kɔndɔ ka wo bolofenilu suɲa a ri cɛɛ fankama wo mira fɔlɔ ka a sidi. Wo kɔrɔ, a ri a bolofenilu suɲa.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />«N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: mɔɔilu hakɛilu bɛɛ ri se makotola, hali Alla tanama kumailu. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka Nii Sɛniman tanama kuma fɔ, a ti se makotola fewu. Hakɛ wo ri to wo tii kan habadan.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Isa ka kuma woilu fɔ ii yɛ ka a masɔrɔn ii ka a fɔ ko jena le a fɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa na ni a dɔɔcɛilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ka Isa to dinkira wo rɔ, a na ni a dɔɔcɛilu nara. Ii ka ii lɔ kɛnɛma ka mɔɔ lɔ a kili la. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Wo ka jama siinin tɛrɛn a laminin dɔ. Doilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I na ni i dɔɔcɛilu lɔnin kɛnɛma. Ii ye i ɲininna.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Yon ye n na ri? N dɔɔcɛilu ye yon ni yon di?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />A ka a ɲa lɔ mɔɔilu rɔ, mɛnilu siinin a laminin dɔ ye. A ka a fɔ ko: «I ma n na ni n dɔɔcɛilu yen? <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Baa mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Alla sawo kɛla, woilu le ye n dɔɔcɛilu ni n dɔɔmusoilu ni n na ri.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuma kɔrɔlama Sifoyila ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Nba, Isa ka mɔɔilu karan damira ikɔ tuun dala dala. Mɔɔ siyaman ba nara ii ladɛn a tɔrɔfɛ. Wo rɔ, a donda kulun do kɔndɔ ka a sii, ka ii mabɔ gbelema la dɔɔnin. Jama bɛɛ tora gbelema. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />A ka ii karan ko siyaman na kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ. Ka a to ii karanna, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Ai ye ai tolo malɔ kosɛbɛ. Sɛnɛkɛla do bɔra ka wa si foyi diya a la sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Si foyitɔla, si doilu bera sila dala. Kɔnɔilu nara wo bɛɛ dɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Si doilu bera farama yɔrɔ kan, banku ma siya yɔrɔ mɛn. Si woilu fɛrɛnda jonna, baa banku tɛrɛ ma siya. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Tele bɔra tuma mɛn na, ii mɔrɔmɔrɔra. Ii jara, baa ii lulu ma jii duu rɔ bakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Si doilu bera nɔnbɔwɔninma yɔrɔ rɔ. Sumanilu wulira mɛn kɛ, wɔninilu fanan wulira ka ii dɔɔn, fɔɔ ii ma se ii denna. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Nba, si doilu fanan bera duu duman dɔ. Suman woilu sɔnda kosɛbɛ. Si doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn bisawa (30) kɛ, doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn biwɔɔrɔ (60) kɛ, doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100) kɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Isa bannin wo fɔla, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Kuma mɛn tolo ye mɔɔ mɛn ma, wo ye a tolo malɔ kuma wo la.»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlamailu fɔ kun mɛn na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />A kelen tɛrɛ ye waati mɛn na a ni a lamininni tɛrɛ mɛnilu la a ni karanden tan ni fila ka ii masɛ jama la ii ka a maɲininka a la kuma kɔrɔlama kɔrɔ ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Alla la mansaya ko mɛn doonnin tɛrɛ, wo lɔnnin da di aile ma. Kɔni ko bɛɛ ye fɔla mɔɔ tɔilu yɛ kuma kɔrɔlamailu le rɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">«‹Ii ri ragbɛli kɛ tuma bɛɛ, kɔni ii tɛ foyi yen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ii ri kuma lamɛn tuma bɛɛ, kɔni ii tɛ foyi famun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ni wo tɛ, ii tun di ii kɔsɛ Alla ma, a tun di yafa ii ma.›»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka sifoyila la kuma kɔrɔlama kɔrɔ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «Ai ma kuma kɔrɔlama ɲin famun wa? Ai don di kuma kɔrɔlama tɔilu famun di?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />«Sifoyila ye le ikomin mɔɔ mɛn ye Alla la kuma lasela. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Si mɛnilu bera sila dala. Yɔrɔ wo ye mɔɔ doilu le munuɲa ri. Mɔɔ woilu wa Alla la kuma lamɛn, Setana ri na i kɔrɔ ka kuma wo bɔ ii jusukun dɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Si mɛnilu bera farama yɔrɔ kan. Yɔrɔ wo fanan ye mɔɔ doilu le munuɲa ri. Mɔɔ woilu wa Alla la kuma lamɛn, ii ri a mira ka sɛwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kɔni kuma wo ti sabati ii jusukun dɔ bɛrɛ bɛrɛ kɛ. Ii tɛ mɛn bakɛ lemɛniya sila kan. Baa ni gbɛlɛnya ka ii sɔrɔn, wala ni mɔɔilu ka ii tɔrɔ Alla la kuma kosɔn, ii ri sila bila i kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Awa, si mɛnilu bera nɔnbɔwɔninma yɔrɔ rɔ. Yɔrɔ wo fanan ye mɔɔ doilu le munuɲa ri. Mɔɔ woilu ka Alla la kuma lamɛn. <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Kɔni dunuɲa koilu hamin di don ii jusukun dɔ. Nanfulu lɔɔ ri ii mira ka ii magbɛrɛn kɛ. Fenilu nata ri gba ii la. Ko woilu bɛɛ kosɔn, Alla la kuma ri mabali ii jusukun dɔ, ka kɛ ikomin sɛnɛrɔfen denbali, mɛn ma den kɛ a la. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Nba, si mɛnilu fanan bera duu duman dɔ. Yɔrɔ wo ye mɔɔ doilu le munuɲa ri. Mɔɔ woilu ye Alla la kuma lamɛnna ka sɔn a ma. Kuma wo ri sabati ii jusukun dɔ. Wo rɔ, ii ye le ikomin suman si, mɛn ye ɲala ka a ɲɔɔn bisawa (30) kɛ, wala a ɲɔɔn biwɔɔrɔ (60) wala a ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100).»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma kɔrɔlama Fitinna la ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «A ye di? Mɔɔ ri na fitinna lamɛlɛnnin di ka a bila see kɔrɔ wa, wala lafen kɔrɔ? A tɛ a sii fitinnasiifen kan wa? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Nba, ko ko doonnin, wo bɛɛ ri lɛnkɛnɛmaya. Gbundu ko si tɛ ye, mɛn tɛ bɔ gbɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Kuma mɛn tolo ye mɔɔ mɛn ma, wo ye a tolo malɔ kuma wo la.»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «Nba, ai ye kuma mɛnilu lamɛnna, ai ye ai miri woilu ma kosɛbɛ. Baa Alla ri ai sɔ ka a bɛn ai la kuma lamɛn kɛ ɲa ma. A ri do fanan la wo kan. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Baa fen ye mɛn bolo, do ri la wo tii ta kan. Kɔni fen tɛ mɛn bolo, hali fitini mɛn ye a bolo, wo ri mira a la.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la mansaya ye ikomin suman si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Isa ka a fɔ ikɔ tuun ko: «Alla la mansaya ye ɲa mɛn ma, ale le ɲin di. A ye le ikomin cɛɛ mɛn ka suman si foyi a la sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Wo kɔ rɔ, cɛɛ wo wa to sunɔɔla su rɔ, ka wuli sɔɔma. Su ni tele suman si wo ye fɛrɛnna ka wuli. Kɔni a tii ma a lɔn wo ye kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Baa duukolo ri suman nafɛrɛn a jɛrɛ ma. Suman di wuli ka kɛ kala ri fɔlɔ, ka ban ka a tɔnsɔn nabɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, a kisɛilu ri kɛ a tɔnsɔn na. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ni kisɛ woilu mɔra tuma mɛn na, a tii ri wɔrɔtɔ ta ka a ka damira. Baa sumanka waati ra se.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma kɔrɔlama Bɔrɔn fira kisɛ la ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Isa ka a fɔ ikɔ tuun ko: «An di se Alla la mansaya lala nfen ma? A ye ɲa mɛn ma, an di kuma kɔrɔlama ɲuman fɔ ka wo yiraka? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />A ye ikomin bɔrɔn fira kisɛ, an wa mɛn lan duu rɔ, hali a dɔɔman ka tamin duukolo kan kisɛ bɛɛ la, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />kɔni ni mɔɔilu wa a lan, a ri wuli ka bonya ka tamin nakɔfen bɛɛ la. A ri bolon bailu labɔ, fɔɔ sankolo kɔnɔilu ri se ii ɲaan lala a bolon lulen na.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Isa tɛrɛ ye Alla la kuma lasela ii ma kuma kɔrɔlama ɲin ɲɔɔn siyaman de rɔ. Mɔɔilu ri se ko ɲayenna ɲa mɛn ma, a ka ii karan wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />A ma kuma si fɔ ii yɛ ni a ma kuma kɔrɔlama fɔ ii yɛ. Kɔni a ni a la karandenilu wa kɛ ii dan na, a ri kuma kɔrɔlama bɛɛ kɔrɔ fɔ ii yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka fɔɲɔ ba lalɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Nba, wo lon jɛrɛ wura dafɛ, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «An ye wa dala kɔma.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Wo rɔ, karandenilu ka jama to ye ka don kulun kɔndɔ, Isa siinin mɛn kɔndɔ. Ii wara a ri ji kan kulun wo kɔndɔ. Kulun gbɛrɛilu bilanin tɛrɛ ii kɔfɛ fanan. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ka ii to ji kan, fɔɲɔ ba do tɛɛra. Jikuru bailu wulira ka don kulun kɔndɔ, fɔɔ kulun fatɔ le tɛrɛ ji la. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Kɔni Isa lanin tɛrɛ sunɔɔ rɔ kulun jula, a kun lanin tɛrɛ kunkɔrɔla do kan. Karandenilu ka a lakunun, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an satɔ le. Wo tɛ i ɲana foyi ri wa?»<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Isa kununda ka fɔɲɔ makuma. A ka a fɔ dala ji yɛ ko: «I sabari, i makun.» Fɔɲɔ lɔra ka jilimalɔ bakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye silanna ten? Ai ma lemɛniya fɔlɔ wa?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ii silanda kojuuya. Ii tɛrɛ a fɔla i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Ɛɛ! Cɛɛ ɲin ye mɔɔ su ɲuman di? Hali fɔɲɔ ni dala ji ye a kan mirala.»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu bannin dala tɛɛla, ii sera Kerase mara rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Isa jiinin ka bɔ kulun kɔndɔ, cɛɛ jenatɔlamɔ do bɔra kaburu so la i kɔrɔ ka na a labɛn. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Cɛɛ wo siinin kaburu so la ye. Mɔɔ si tun ti se a sidila butun. Hali ni mɔɔilu ka a sidi jɔlɔkɔ la, a ri wo tɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Baa mɔɔilu ka a boloilu sidi jɔlɔkɔ la, ka a senilu don siɲa siyaman nɛɛ la. Kɔni a ka jɔlɔkɔilu tɛɛ, ka nɛɛ kadikadi. Fanka tun tɛ mɔɔ si la ka a lamara ka a kɔnɔgbɛn. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Su ni tele a tɛrɛ ye kulela ka a jɛrɛ madimin kabakudunilu la kaburu so la, a ni koyinkɛilu kan.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Awa, a ka Isa yen tuma mɛn na ka a to yɔrɔ jan, a ka a bori ka na a tin birin duu ma a kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />A kulera kan ba la ko: «Ile Isa, Alla Kɔrɔtaninba Dencɛ, i ye n to ye! N ye i madiyala Alla tɔɔ rɔ, i kana n tɔrɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />A ka wo fɔ, ka a masɔrɔn Isa tun ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Jena, i ye bɔ cɛɛ ɲin fɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Isa ka a maɲininka ko: «I tɔɔ di?» A ka Isa jabi: «N tɔɔ le ko Jama Ba, baa an ka siya.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />A tora Isa madiyala ko a kana ii gbɛn ka bɔ mara rɔ ye.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn kɔsɛ kuru ba ye dɔɔnninna tindi la ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Jenailu ka Isa madiya ko: «I ye an nawa kɔsɛilu tɛma sa an di don woilu rɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Isa diɲɛra. Jenailu bɔra cɛɛ wo fɛ ka wa don kɔsɛilu rɔ. Wo rɔ, kɔsɛilu bɛɛ ka ii bori ka jii tindi la ka wa don dala ji rɔ. Ii bɛɛ tɔra ji rɔ. Ii tun di kɔsɛ waa fila (2,000) ɲɔɔn bɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wo kɛnin, kɔsɛgbɛnnailu ka ii bori ka wa wo kibaro fɔ so kɔndɔ mɔɔilu ni toda kɔrɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ. Mɔɔilu wulira ka na ko woilu ragbɛ diya. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ii senin Isa ma, ii ka jenatɔlamɔ kɔrɔ siinin yen, jena siyaman tɛrɛ ye mɛn fɛ kɔrɔman. Durukiba ye a kan na, a mafanin. Wo rɔ, ii bɛɛ silanda.<verse eid="MRK 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Nba, ko woilu kɛra mɛnilu ɲana, woilu tora a lakalila mɔɔilu yɛ mɛn kɛra jenatɔlamɔ la, a ni mɛn kɛra kɔsɛilu la fanan. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Mɔɔilu ka ko woilu mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii wulira ka a kɛ Isa madiya ri ko a ye bɔ ii la mara rɔ ka wa.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Isa dontɔla kulun kɔndɔ, jenatɔlamɔ kɔrɔ ka a madiya ko a ye a fɛ ka bila Isa kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Isa ma sɔn; kɔni a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Wa i wara, ka i la denbayailu tɛrɛn ye. Maari ra mɛn kɛ i yɛ, i ye wo bɛɛ lakali ii yɛ, ka a fɔ ii yɛ a ra kininkinin i ma ɲa mɛn ma.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Wo rɔ cɛɛ wara. Isa tun ka mɛn kɛ a yɛ, a ka wo bɛɛ lakali damira Dɛkapɔli mara rɔ. Ko woilu ka mɔɔ bɛɛ kabannakoya.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muso jankarɔtɔ a ni Jayirusi denmuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Isa ka dala tɛɛ tuma mɛn na, jama ba nara a tɛrɛn dala dala ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ka ii to ye, salibon kuntii do nara mɛn tɔɔ ko Jayirusi. A ka Isa yen tuma mɛn na, a ka a be a sen kɔrɔ <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ka Isa madiya kosɛbɛ ko: «N denmusonin satɔla le. I jaandi, i ye na ka i bolo la a kan sa a ri kɛndɛya ka to a nii la.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Isa ni ale wara. Jama ba bilara ii kɔfɛ fɔɔ ka Isa ragbɛrɛn ii tɛma.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn muso jankarɔtɔ do ye ye. Wo ra san tan ni fila kɛ jelibɔ jankarɔ ye a la. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />A tun da tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ dandalila siyaman bolo. A bolofen bɛɛ ra ban. Kɔni a la jankarɔ ma nɔya fɔɔ ka juuya. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Muso wo tun ka Isa kibaro mɛn. Wo rɔ, a nara don jama tɛma Isa kɔfɛ ka a maa a la duruki la, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />baa a tɛrɛ a mirila a jɛrɛ kɔndɔ ko: «Ni n sera n maala a la duruki gbansan na, n di kɛndɛya.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />A ka a maa mɛn kɛ Isa la duruki la, a la jelibɔ lalɔra i kɔrɔ. A ka a lɔn a fari rɔ ko a ra kɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Isa ka a lɔn a jɛrɛ ma kelendi ko sebaya do ra bɔ a rɔ. A ka a kɔfɛnɛn jama tɛma ka a fɔ ko: «Yon de ka a maa n na duruki la?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />A la karandenilu ka a fɔ ko: «A ragbɛ, jama ye i ragbɛrɛnna ii tɛma. I ri se a fɔla wo rɔ ko ‹Yon ka a maa n na?» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kɔni Isa ka a ɲalakalan a laminin dɔ, sa a ri wo tii yen. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Muso ka a lɔn mɛn kɛ. Wo rɔ, a nara a be Isa sen kɔrɔ ka a gbɛ a yɛ. A silannin fɔɔ ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N denmuso, i ra kisi ka a masɔrɔn i lemɛniyara n ma. Wa jususuma rɔ, i ra kɛndɛya i la jankarɔ rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ka Isa to kuma wo la, mɔɔ doilu nara ka bɔ salibon kuntii Jayirusi wara. Ii ka a fɔ Jayirusi yɛ ko: «I denmuso ra sa, i kana karanmɔɔ tɔrɔ butun.» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Isa ka kuma wo mɛn, kɔni a ka a fɔ salibon kuntii yɛ ko: «I kana silan, i ye lemɛniya n ma dɔrɔn.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Isa ma sɔn mɔɔ si ye wa a malɔ fɔɔ Piyɛri ni Yakuba ni Yakuba dɔɔcɛ Yuhana. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nba, ii senin salibon kuntii wara mɛn kɛ, Isa ka mankan tɛrɛn ye. Mɔɔilu ye kasila, ka kule bakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Isa donda bon na ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye mankan nabɔla? Nfenna ai ye kasila? Den sanin tɛ, a ye sunɔɔ le rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mɔɔ woilu ka a lafɛya. Kɔni a ka ii bɛɛ labɔ kɛnɛma. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka den fa ni a na ta, a ni mɛnilu ye a tɔrɔfɛ ye. Ii donda bon kɔndɔ, den su lanin mɛn kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Isa ka den mira a bolo ma ka a fɔ a yɛ ii la kan dɔ ko: «Talita kumi.» Wo kɔrɔ le ko: «Sunkurunnin, n ye a fɔla i yɛ ko i wuli.»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Sunkurunnin wulira i kɔrɔ ka a kɛ taamataama ri. Ii bɛɛ kabannakoyara, fɔɔ ka a dan natamin. Den sɔrɔn tun da san tan ni fila bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya ko ii kana ko wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko ii ye dɔɔnnin di den ma.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nasarɛtikailu ka ii ban Isa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Nba, Isa bɔra yɔrɔ wo rɔ ka wa a wara so kɔndɔ. A la karandenilu wara a malɔ diya. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ɲɔɲɔ Lon senin, Isa wara mɔɔilu karan damira salibon na. A lamɛnbailu tun ka siya ye. Ii kabannakoyara ka a fɔ ko: «A ye ko mɛnilu fɔla ɲin di, a ka woilu karan min? Yon ka walijiya wo di a ma? A ye kabannako mɛnilu kɛla ɲin di, a ye woilu kɛla di? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Jiribaarala le tɛ wo ri wa? Mariyamu dencɛ le tɛ wa? A dɔɔcɛilu tɛ Yakuba ni Jose ni Juda ni Simɔn di wa? A nakelenɲɔɔ musoilu siinin tɛ an tɛma yan wa?» Ii la miriya wo le kɛra sababu ri Isa gboyara ii yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔilu ye Alla la keladen fisamante bonyala yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ fɔɔ a jɛrɛ wara, a ni a badenmailu ni a la denbayailu tɛma.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Isa ma se kabannako kɛla ye fɔɔ ka a bolo la jankarɔtɔ dɔndɔ kan ka ii lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ye mɔɔilu ma sɔn lemɛniyala mɛn kɛ, wo ka a kabannakoya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Isa ka a la talibidenba tan ni fila kelaya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa tɛrɛ a taamataamala so wo laminin soilu la ka mɔɔilu karan. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Isa ka a la talibidenba tan ni fila kili ka ii kelaya mɔɔ fila fila. A ka jena gbɛn se di ii ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai kana foyi ta taama rɔ, fɔɔ ai la taama gbeleke. Ai kana dɔɔnninfen ta, wala bɔrɔ. Ai kana wodi bila ai kun. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ai ye sanbara don ai sen dɔ, kɔni ai kana duruki kɔrɔbila fila bila ai kan na.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «Ni mɔɔ do ka ai jiya, ai ye to wo bolo fɔɔ ka se ai bɔ lon ma so wo kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ni so mɛn mɔɔilu ti nala sɔnna ka ai jiya, ni wo tɛ, ni ii ti nala sɔnna ai la kuma ma, ai ye bɔ ye. Ai bɔtɔla, ai ye gbangban bɔ ai sen ma. Wo ri kɛ sere ri ye mɔɔilu kanma ko ii ma ɲin.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nba, karandenilu bɔra ye ka wa mɔɔilu kawandi ko ii ye tubi ka na Alla ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ii ka jena siyaman gbɛn ka ii bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ. Ii ka tulu dɔɔnin kɛ jankarɔtɔ siyaman kun dɔ ka ii lakɛndɛya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herodi ka Yaya faa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Awa, Isa la ko fɔra mansa Herodi yɛ, baa Isa tɔɔ bɔnin fan bɛɛ rɔ. Mɔɔ doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Yaya ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. Wo le ka a kɛ, sebaya ye a bolo ka kabannakoilu kɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Eliya le a ri.» Doilu fanan ka a fɔ ko: «Keladen fisamante le a ri, mɛn ye fɔlɔfɔlɔ kelalaselailu do ɲɔɔn di.»<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kɔni Herodi ka ko woilu mɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ ko: «Yaya mɛn kun tɛɛra a la n bolo, wo ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Baa Herodi le tun ka jamarili di a la mɔɔilu ma ko ii ye Yaya mira ka a sidi ka a bila kaso la. Herodi ka wo kɛ a kɔrɔcɛ Filipe muso le la ko kosɔn, mɛn tɔɔ ko Herodiyasi. Herodi tun ka wo furu. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Baa Yaya tora a fɔla a yɛ ko: «I kɔrɔcɛ muso ma kan ka sii i kun. Wo dahani tɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Yaya la ko gboyara Herodiyasi yɛ kojuuya. A lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye a la ka Yaya faa. Kɔni a ma ɲa sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Baa Herodi silanni tɛrɛ Yaya yɛ. Wo rɔ, a tɛrɛ Yaya lakandanna koɲuma. A ka a lɔn ko Yaya ye mɔɔ telennin de ri, a ni mɔɔ sɛniman. A wa a tolo malɔ Yaya la, a hankili ri ɲaamin. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, a la kumailu duman a yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ka ii to wo la, Herodiyasi sawona lon sera. Herodi sɔrɔnlon sankunbɛn kɛra lon mɛn, a ka tolon ba rabɛn ka a la ɲɛmɔɔilu kili, a ni tɛsidi kuntiilu ni Kalile mɔɔbailu. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ka mɔɔilu ladɛnnin to tolon diya, Herodiyasi denmuso donda tolon diya ka dɔn kɛ. A diyara Herodi ni a la mɔɔ makilini bɛɛ yɛ. Herodi ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye mɛn fɛ, i ye a fɔ. N di a di i ma.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Herodi ka lahidi ta a yɛ ka a kali ko: «Ni i ka fen fen tara n na, n di a di i ma, hali ni a kɛra n na mansaya talantɛ ri.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Sunkurun bɔra ye ka wa a na maɲininka ko: «N ka kan ka nfen de ɲinin a fɛ?» A na ka a jabi: «A fɔ ko a ye Yaya kun di i ma.»<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Sunkurun ka a kaliya ka a kɔsɛ Herodi ma i kɔrɔ. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N ye a fɛ i ye Yaya kun di n ma muran do kan sisɛn sisɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Kuma wo ka mansa niilafin kosɛbɛ. Kɔni a tun tɛ a fɛ ka a ban sunkurun na kuma ma. Baa a tun da ban a kalila a la mɔɔ makiliniilu bɛɛ ɲana. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Wo rɔ, a ka a la kuntɛɛla do kelaya i kɔrɔ ko a ye wa Yaya kun tɛɛ a la ka na a ri. Cɛɛ wo wara kaso bon na ka Yaya kun tɛɛ a la. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />A ka kun wo bila muran do kan ka na a di sunkurun ma. Sunkurun wara a di a na ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Yaya la karandenilu ka a faa ko mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii wara a su ta ka wa a sutura.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka dɔɔnnin di jama ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Nba, Isa tun ka talibidenba mɛnilu kelaya, woilu ka ii kɔsɛ ka na Isa tɛrɛn. Ii tun ka ko mɛnilu bɛɛ kɛ, a ni ii tun ka mɔɔilu karan ɲa mɛn ma, ii ka wo bɛɛ dantɛɛ Isa yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Wo tuma, mɔɔ siyaman tɛrɛ taa ni sɛ kɛla. Wo bolo ma, Isa ni a la karandenilu ma dɔɔnnin fɛrɛ sɔrɔn. Wo rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ karandenilu yɛ ko: «An ye bɔ yan ka wa an dan na wula kɔndɔ. Ai ri ai ɲɔɲɔ dɔɔnin ye.»<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Wo le rɔ, ii donda kulun do kɔndɔ ka dala tɛɛ, ka wa ii dan na wula kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kɔni mɔɔ siyaman ka ii watɔla yen kulun kɔndɔ, ka a lɔn ko iile le ye. Wo rɔ, ii bɔra ye soilu bɛɛ la ka ii bori ka wa se Isa ni karandenilu wa diya.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Isa bɔra kulun kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, a ka jama ba yen ye. Ii kininkinin donda a rɔ, baa ii kɛnin a ɲana ikomin saailu, gbɛngbɛnna tɛ mɛnilu la. A ka ii karan damira fen siyaman na. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Awa, ka a tɛrɛn su kotɔla le, a la karandenilu ka ii madon a la ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ, an ye wula le kɔndɔ yan. Su kotɔla le. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />I ye sila di jama ma sa ii ri wa dɔɔnnifen san yan naminin bondailu la, a ni so mɛsɛnilu kɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai jɛrɛ ye dɔɔnnin di ii ma.» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «An di se wo la di? I ye a fɛ an ye wa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Waati wo rɔ wodi gbanan kɛmɛ fila (200) wo tɛrɛ ye mɔɔ kelen karo seyin baara sara le ri</char></note>wodi gbanan kɛmɛ fila (200) le san buru la ka a di jama ma wa?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Isa ka ii maɲininka ko: «Buru yɛli ye ai bolo? Ai ye wa a ragbɛ.» Ii wara ka na a jabi: «Burukala loolu ye yan, a ni jɛɛ fila.»<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Wo rɔ a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ye mɔɔilu kuru kuru lasii duu ma bin kɛndɛ kan. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Mɔɔilu ka ii sii mɔɔ kɛmɛ kɛmɛ (100), doilu fanan ka ii biloolu loolu sii kɛ (50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Isa ka burukala loolu ni jɛɛ fila ta, ka a ɲa layɛlɛ sankolo rɔ ka baraka bila Alla yɛ. A ka buru rakadikadi, ka a di a la karandenilu ma ko ii ye a ratala jama tɛma. A ka jɛɛ fila wo fanan ratala jama bɛɛ tɛma wo ɲa kelen ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii fa. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Jama bannin dɔɔnninna, Isa la karandenilu ka buru ni jɛɛ kunkundun tɔilu ladɛn, ka see tan ni fila lafa wo la. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Jama mɛn ka dɔɔnnin wo kɛ, cɛɛ waa loolu (5,000) tɛrɛ ye a rɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a taama ji kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ i kɔrɔ ko ii ye don kulun kɔndɔ. Ii ye dala tɛɛ ka wa a ɲɛfɛ Bɛtisayida so fan fɛ. Ale watɔ sila dila jama ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nba, Isa wara sila di jama ma, ka ban ka wa Alla tara diya koyinkɛ do kan. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Su kora ka karandenilu to kulun kɔndɔ dala tɛma. Isa kelen pe ye gbelema. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />A ka a yen ko karandenilu ra sɛɛ kosɛbɛ kulun borila, baa fɔɲɔ ye ii kunbɛnna. Dondon kasi waati ɲɔɔn, Isa ka a taama ji kan ka wa ii kɔfɛ. A sera ii ma ka a kɛ ikomin a ye taminna ii la. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Kɔni karandenilu ka a taamatɔla yen ji kan tuma mɛn na, a kɛra ii ɲana ikomin su kɔrɔ do jiya le. Ii wulira ka a kɛ kule ri, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />baa ii bɛɛ ka a yen ka silan kojuuya. A kumara ii yɛ i kɔrɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye ai jusulatɛɛ! Nde le. Ai kana silan!»<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a donda ii fɛ kulun kɔndɔ. Fɔɲɔ ka a lɔ. Karandenilu kabannakoyara fɔɔ ka ii kɔnda ban. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Baa Isa tun ka buru lasiyaya kabannako mɛn kɛ, ii tun ma wo kɔrɔ famun fɔlɔ. Ii hankili datununnin tɛrɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jankarɔtɔilu lakɛndɛya Kɛnesarɛti mara rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Nba, ii ban mɛn kɛnin dala tɛɛla, ii sera Kɛnesarɛti mara rɔ. Ii ka kulun nalɔ dala dala ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ii bɔ mɛn kɛnin kulun kɔndɔ dɔrɔn, ye mɔɔilu ka Isa lɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ii ka ii bori ka wa mara fan bɛɛ rɔ. Ni ii ka a mɛn ko Isa ye yɔrɔ mɛn, ii ri wa jankarɔtɔilu ri lafen kan ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Isa wa wa yɔrɔ yɔrɔ, so bailu ni so mɛsɛnilu ni bondailu bɛɛ, mɔɔilu ri na jankarɔtɔilu ri ka ii la lɔɔfɛ rɔ, ka a madiya ko a ye sɔn ii ye ii maa a la duruki dakun gbansan na. Jankarɔtɔ mɛnilu ka ii maa a la, woilu bɛɛ kɛndɛyara.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Farisiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔ doilu mɛn bɔra Jerusalɛmu, woilu nara ii ladɛn Isa laminin dɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ii ka a yen ko a la karanden doilu ye dɔɔnnin kɛla, ka a tɛrɛn ii bolo <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo kɔrɔ le ko ii tun ma ii bolo lako ka a bɛn Judiyailu la dina namun ma</char></note>lakɔsɔnnin, ii ma woilu lako ikomin ii la namun kɛɲa.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Baa Farisiilu ni Judiya tɔilu ti sɔnna ka dɔɔnnin kɛ na ii ma ii boloilu lako koɲuma ka a bɛn ii benbailu la namun ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ii wa bɔ lɔɔfɛ rɔ, ii tɛ dɔɔnnin kɛla na ii ma ii ko fɔlɔ. Ii ye namun gbɛrɛ siyaman ba labatola, misaliya rɔ ye ii la jilafɛ mɛsɛnilu ni jilafɛ bailu a ni nɛɛdaailu fanan dakola.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Wo rɔ, Farisiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ka Isa maɲininka ko: «Nfenna i la karandenilu tɛ an benbailu la namun nabatola? Nfenna ii ye dɔɔnnin kɛla ka a tɛrɛn ii ma ii bolo lako fɔlɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu, Esayi ka mɛn fɔ ai la ko rɔ fɔlɔfɔlɔ, wo bɛnnin kosɛbɛ. Baa a ka Alla kan sɛbɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">«‹Mɔɔ ɲinilu ye n bonyala ii da le la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">kɔni ii jusukun ma senin nde la muumɛ!<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ii ye n batola fuu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">Ii ye mɔɔilu karanna mɛnilu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">woilu tɛ foyi ri fɔɔ adamadenilu la jamariliilu.›<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />«Ai ra Alla la jamariliilu to ye, ka mɔɔilu la namunilu labato.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai kiyanin, baa ai bannin Alla la jamariliilu ma, sa ai ri to ai la namunilu kan. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: ‹I fa ni i na bonya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛn sɛbɛnin yan a ye Hɔrɔya suran 20 kuma diya 12, wo ni Sariyailu fanan kɔndɔ suran 5 kuma diya 16</char></note>› Ko: ‹Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka kuma juu fɔ a fa ma, wala a na, wo tii ka kan de ka faa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛn sɛbɛni yan a ye Hɔrɔya suran 21 kuma diya 17, wo ni Sarakalaselailu fanan kɔndɔ suran 20 kuma diya 9</char></note>.› <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kɔni ai ka a fɔ ko mɔɔ ri se a fɔla a fa wala a na yɛ ko: ‹I ka kan ka dɛmɛnfen mɛn sɔrɔn n bolo, wo ra kɛ Kɔrɔban di.› (Wo kɔrɔ le ko ‹n da wo bila a dan na Alla yɛ.›) <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Ni a ka wo le fɔ, ai ti sɔnna butun a ye a sɔrɔnbailu dɛmɛn. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Wo bolo ma, ai ka namun mɛnilu sɔrɔn ai benbailu la, ai ye woilu kɛla ka ii bila Alla la kuma nɔ rɔ. Ai ye wo ɲɔɔn ko siyaman fanan kɛla.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fen mɛnilu ye mɔɔ nɔɔla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka jama kili ikɔ tuun, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ye ai tolo malɔ n na kuma la ka a famun. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Mɔɔ ye fen fen donna a da rɔ ka a dɔɔn, wo si ti se mɔɔ nɔɔla. Kɔni fen mɛnilu ye bɔla mɔɔ rɔ, wo le ye mɔɔ nɔɔla.» <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔɔ mɛn tolo ye ye wo ye a tolo malɔ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Isa bɔra jama fɛ ka wa don bon kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, a la karandenilu ka a maɲininka kuma kɔrɔlama wo kɔrɔ ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «A ye di? Ai fanan ma se ko ɲayenna wa? Ai ma a ɲayen wa ko fen mɛn ye donna mɔɔ kɔndɔ, wo ti se a tii nɔɔla? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Baa dɔɔnnifen si tɛ donna mɔɔ jusukun dɔ fɔɔ a kɔnɔ le. A tii wa wa kɔkan, fen woilu ri bɔ.» Nba, Isa ka a yiraka wo rɔ ko dɔɔnnifen bɛɛ ri se dɔɔnna.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ fanan ko: «Fen mɛnilu ye bɔla mɔɔ rɔ, wo le ye a nɔɔla. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Baa miriya juuilu le ye bɔla mɔɔ jusukun dɔ, ikomin jalonya, suɲali, mɔɔfaa, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kaninkɛ, natabaya, juuya, mɔɔ lafili, jamuruya, keleya, mɔɔ tɔɔtiɲan, jɛrɛbonya, a ni hankilitanya koilu. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Juuya woilu bɛɛ ye bɔla mɔɔ jusukun dɔ. Ii bɛɛ le ye mɔɔ nɔɔla.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirɛkika muso do lara Isa la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa bɔra Judiyailu la jamana rɔ ye ka wa Tiri mara rɔ. A senin mɛn kɛ ye, a donda mɔɔ do wara. A tun tɛ a fɛ mɔɔ si ye a lɔn ko a ye ye. Kɔni wo bɛɛ ni a ta, wo ko fɔra. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Muso do tɛrɛ ye ye, jena ye a denmuso fɛ. Muso wo ka Isa na ko mɛn tuma mɛn na, a nara Isa tɛrɛn ye i kɔrɔ ka a be a sen kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Muso wo ye Kirɛkika le ri, a sɔrɔnda Siri Fenisi jamana kɔndɔ. Nba, a ka Isa madiya bakɛ ko a ye jena gbɛn ka a bɔ a denmuso fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kɔni Isa ka a jabi sanda rɔ ko: «A to denilu ye dɔɔnnin kɛ fɔlɔ ka fa. Baa ka denilu la dɔɔnnin ta ka a lafili wuluniilu kɔrɔ, wo ma ɲin.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Muso ka a jabi: «Maari, tuɲa le wo ri. Kɔni denilu wa kɛ dɔɔnninna, dɔɔnnin buruburu mɛn ye bela duu ma tabali kɔrɔ, wuluniilu ye wo le dɔɔnna.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I la jabili ɲin kosɔn, i ye wa i wara. Jena ra bɔ i denmuso fɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Muso wara a wara, ka a den lanin tɛrɛn lafen kan, jena ra bɔ a fɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka cɛɛ tolo gbɛdɛn do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Nba, Isa bɔra Tiri mara rɔ ka tamin Sidɔn so kɔndɔ, ka bɔ ye ka Dɛkapɔli mara rasan ka wa Kalile Dala fan fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Mɔɔ doilu nara cɛɛ do malɔ Isa ma ye. Cɛɛ wo tolo gbɛdɛnnin. Kuma fanan gbɛlɛnman a ma kosɛbɛ. Ii ka Isa madiya ko a ye a bolo la cɛɛ wo kan ka a lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Isa wara cɛɛ ri a dan na, ka a mabɔ jama la. A ka a bolokoyinilu don cɛɛ tolo woilu rɔ, ka ban ka a daji tu ka wo kɛ cɛɛ nɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka a ɲakɔrɔta san ma ka a nilakili lajii bakɛ ka a fɔ ii la kan dɔ ko: «Efata.» Wo kɔrɔ le ko: «i ye laka!»<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Cɛɛ tolo fila bɛɛ lakara i kɔrɔ. A nɛnjuilu fulɛnda, a sera kumala koɲuma. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Isa ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya ko ii kana ko wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, hali ni a ka ii da matintin ko tan, ii ma wo lase boloka muumɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Mɔɔ woilu kabannakoyara fɔɔ ka a dan natamin. Ii tɛrɛ ye a fɔla ko: «A ye ko ko kɛla, wo bɛɛ ka ɲin. A ye tologbedenilu tolo lakala, ka a kɛ boboilu ye kumala fanan!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka dɔɔnnin di mɔɔ waa naanin (4,000) ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Wo lon wo rɔ, jama ba nara ii ladɛn ikɔ tuun. Dɔɔnninfen tun tɛ ii bolo. Wo rɔ, Isa ka a la karandenilu kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«N kininkininnin jama ɲin ma. Dɔɔnninfen si tɛ ii bolo yan, ka a masɔrɔn ai ra tele sawa kɛ n dafɛ yan. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ni n ka sila di ii kɔnkɔtɔ ma ko ii ye wa ii wara, ii fanka ri dɛsɛ sila la. Baa ii doilu bɔ diya ka jan.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />A la karandenilu ka a jabi: «An di buru sɔrɔn min wula kɔndɔ yan, mɛn di jama ɲin bɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Isa ka ii maɲininka ko: «Burukala yɛli ye ai bolo?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Burukala wɔrɔnwula.»<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />A ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko ii ye ii sii duu ma. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka burukala wɔrɔnwula wo ta ka baraka bila Alla yɛ, ka a rakadikadi ka a di a la karandenilu ma ko ii ye a ratalan jama la. Ii ka buru ta ka a ratalantalan jama tɛma. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Jɛɛ mɛsɛnnin dɔndɔ fanan tɛrɛ ye ii bolo. Isa ka baraka bila Alla yɛ woilu la, ka a fɔ karandenilu yɛ ko ii ye wo fanan ratalantalan jama la. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii fa. Buru kunkundun ni jɛɛ tɔ mɛn tonin, Isa la karandenilu ka see wɔrɔnwula lafa wo la. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ka dɔɔnnin kɛ, woilu tun di mɔɔ waa naanin (4,000) ɲɔɔn bɔ. Awa, Isa ka sila di ii ma ko ii ye wa. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />A ni a la karandenilu donda kulun do kɔndɔ i kɔrɔ, ka wa Dalimanuta mara rɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisiilu ka a fɔ ko Isa ye tɔɔmasere do kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Farisiilu nara ka Isa sɔsɔ damira. Ii ka a fɔ ko a ye tɔɔmasere kabannako do kɛ, mɛn di a yiraka ko Alla le a fɛ. Ii ka wo fɔ a kɔrɔbɔ kanma. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Isa ka a nilakili lajii bakɛ, ka a fɔ ko: «Nfenna bi mɔɔilu ye tɔɔmasere kabannako ɲininna? N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ko tɔɔmasere si tɛ yiraka bi mɔɔilu la.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />A bannin wo fɔla, Isa ka ii to ye. A donda kokura kulun kɔndɔ ka wa dala kɔma.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisiilu ni Herodi kana kɛ mɔɔilu bolo ikomin lɛbɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Karandenilu ɲinara, ii ma buru ta. Foyi tun tɛ ii bolo kulun kɔndɔ fɔɔ burukala kelen pe. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya ko: «Ai ye a kɛ koɲuma. Farisiilu ni Herodi kana kɛ ai bolo ikomin lɛbɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Karandenilu ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Buru tɛ an bolo yan. Wo le ka a kɛ, a ka kuma wo fɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Isa ka ii miriya wo lɔn. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye a fɔla ko buru tɛ ai bolo? Hankili tɛ ai la ka koilu famun fɔlɔ wa? Ai hankili datununnin wa? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ɲa ye ai ma, ai ti yennin kɛla wa? Tolo ye ai ma, ai tɛ mɛnnin kɛla wa? Ai hankili tɛ bilala fen kɔ wa? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />N ka burukala loolu rakadikadi waati mɛn na ko ai ye wo di mɔɔ waa loolu (5,000) ma, ai ka see yɛli le lafa buru kunkundun tɔ la?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «See tan ni fila.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />A ka a fɔ ko: «N ka burukala wɔrɔnwula rakadikadi waati mɛn na ko ai ye wo di mɔɔ waa naanin (4,000) ma, ai ka see yɛli le lafa buru kunkundun tɔ la?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «See wɔrɔnwula.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «A ye di? Ai ma a ɲayen fɔlɔ wa?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲa funyen do ɲa laka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Bɛtisayida so kɔndɔ. Mɔɔ doilu nara ɲa funyen do ri Isa ma ka a madiya ko a ye a bolo la a kan ka a lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Isa ka ɲa funyen mira a bolo ma ka bɔ so kɔndɔ a ri. A ka daji mun ɲa funyen ɲa la, ka a bolo la a kan, ka ban ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye fen doilu yenna sisɛn wa?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Cɛɛ ka a ɲa layɛlɛ ka yennin kɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «N ɲayen mɔɔilu la. Ii kɛnin ikomin jiriilu le, mɛnilu ye taamataamala.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Isa ka a bolo birin a ɲa la ikɔ tuun. Cɛɛ ɲa lakara. A kɛndɛyara. A ka fen bɛɛ yen koɲuma. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Isa ka sila di a ma ko a ye wa a wara. Ko kɔni a kana don so kɔndɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko Isa ye Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu ka sila mira ka wa Sesare Filipi laminin soilu rɔ. Ka ii to sila kan, Isa ka ii maɲininka ko: «Mɔɔilu ye nde jatela yon di?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ii ka a jabi: «Doilu ka a fɔ ko i ye Yaya le ri. Doilu ka a fɔ ko i ye Eliya le ri. Dogbɛrɛilu ka a fɔ ko keladen fisamante kelen de i ri.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai don? Ai ye n jatela yon di?» Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko: «I ye Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya kosɛbɛ ko ii kana wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a saya ko fɔ ni a wuli ko bɔ saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a kɛ a la karandenilu karan di. A ka a fɔ ko Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ. Mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ni Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ri ii ban a rɔ ka a faa. Kɔni tele sawana lon a ri wuli saya rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Isa ka ko wo fɔ ka a gbɛ. Wo rɔ, Piyɛri ka a kili ka a mabɔ talibidenba tɔilu la dɔɔnin, ka a makuma damira. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kɔni Isa ka a tiliminnin tuma mɛn na ka a la karandenilu ragbɛ, a ka Piyɛri makuma ko: «Ile, Setana. Bɔ n kɔrɔ! Baa Alla sawo ye mɛn di, i tɛ i mirila wo ma, fɔɔ mɔɔilu sawo.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka jama ni a la karandenilu kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a bila n kɔ, fɔɔ wo tii ye a ban a jɛrɛ rɔ ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri mira ka a jɛrɛ bila n kɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Baa mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a nii lakisi, wo tii ri bɔnɔ. Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn bɔnɔra a nii rɔ nde ni kibaro ɲuma kosɔn, wo tii ri a jɛrɛ nii lakisi. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />A ye di? Ni mɔɔ ka dunuɲa bɛɛ sɔrɔn ka bɔnɔ a nii rɔ, dunuɲa sɔrɔn ka nfen ɲa a ma wo rɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mɔɔ ri se nfen dila ka a nii kunka? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Bi mɔɔilu muruntini Alla kanma. Ii ye kojuukɛlailu le ri. Awa, ni mɔɔ do maloyara nde la a ni n na kumailu la mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ mɛnilu ye kojuukɛlailu ni muruntiilu ri, wo tii la ko ri nde Mɔɔ Dencɛ maloya wo lon, n wa na n Fa nɔɔrɔ rɔ mɛlɛka sɛnimanilu fɛ lon mɛn na.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «N ye tuɲa fɔla ai yɛ. Doilu ye yan, mɛnilu ti nala sala fɔɔ ai wa a yen ai ɲa la ko Alla la mansaya ra na sebaya rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ɲakɔrɔda yɛlɛmanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Nba, tele wɔɔrɔ taminnin kɔ, Isa ka Piyɛri ni Yakuba ni Yuhana kili ka wa ii ri koyinkɛ jan do kan. Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ tun tɛ ye. Ka ii to yɔrɔ wo rɔ, Isa ɲakɔrɔda yɛlɛmanda talibidenba sawa woilu ɲana. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />A la faaninilu gbɛra kosɛbɛ fɔɔ ka mɛlɛnmɛlɛn. A gbɛni tɛrɛ ɲa mɛn ma, faaninkola si tɛ duukolo kan mɛn di se faanin kola ka a gbɛ ten. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Talibiden sawa ka Eliya ni Musa fanan yen. Woilu ni Isa tɛrɛ ye kumala i ɲɔɔn yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an na yan, wo bɛnnin. An tɛ gba sawa lɔ wa, i ta kelen, Musa ta kelen, a ni Eliya ta kelen.»<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ii silannin tɛrɛ kojuuya, Piyɛri ma a lɔn a ye mɛn fɔla. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Wo tuma, sanfin nara ka birin ii kun na. Kumakan do bɔra duru rɔ ko: «N dencɛ le ɲin di. A duman n yɛ. Ai ye ai tolo malɔ a la.» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Talibidenilu ka ii ɲa lakalan ii laminin dɔ i kɔrɔ, kɔni ii ma mɔɔ si yen butun, fɔɔ Isa kelen pe.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ka Isa ni a la talibidenilu to jiila ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan, a ka ii jamari ka a fɔ ko ii ka fen mɛn yen, ko ii kana wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ, fɔɔ Mɔɔ Dencɛ ye wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Talibidenilu ka kuma wo labato. Kɔni ii tɛrɛ i ɲɔɔn maɲininkala ko «ka wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ wo kɔrɔ ye nfen di?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfenna sariya karanmɔɔilu ye a fɔla ko Eliya fɔlɔ le ka kan ka na?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Isa ka ii jabi ko: «Tuɲa le, fɔɔ Eliya le fɔlɔ ye na, ka fen bɛɛ rabɛn. Kɔni nfenna a sɛbɛnin Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ ko Mɔɔ Dencɛ ka kan ka tɔrɔ kojuuya, ko mɔɔilu ri a bɔrɔbɔ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />N ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko Eliya ra ban nala. Kɔni mɔɔilu ka ii sawona koilu bɛɛ kɛ a la ikomin a sɛbɛnin ɲa mɛn ma a la ko rɔ Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka dennin jenatɔlamɔ do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Nba, Isa ni talibidenba sawa woilu nara karandenilu tɛrɛn ye, ka jama ba lɔnin yen woilu laminin dɔ. Ii ni sariya karanmɔɔ doilu tɛrɛ i ɲɔɔn masɔsɔla. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Jama ka Isa yen tuma mɛn na, ii kabannakoyara kosɛbɛ. Ii ka ii bori i kɔrɔ ka wa a tuwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Isa ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai ni woilu ye ai ɲɔɔn masɔsɔla nfen ma?»<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nba, cɛɛ do lɔnin tora jama tɛma ka Isa jabi: «Karanmɔɔ, n nanin n dencɛ ri i ma. Jena le ye a fɛ mɛn da a kɛ bobo ri. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ni jena wo wulira a la yɔrɔ mɛn, a ri a labe duu ma. Den da kanfa ri bɔ, a ri a ɲin macin. A fari ri ja a ma. N ka i la karandenilu madiya ko ii ye jena wo gbɛn, kɔni ii ma se.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai, bi mɔɔilu! Ai tɛ lemɛniyala! N di mɛn ai dafɛ fɔɔ tuma ɲuman? N di ai la koilu muɲun fɔɔ waati ɲuman? Ai ye na den di n ma yan.»<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ii nara den di. Jena ka Isa yen tuma mɛn na, a ka den nayɛrɛyɛrɛ i kɔrɔ. Den bera duu ma ka a makurukuru. A da kanfa ye bɔla. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Isa ka den fa maɲininka ko: «A ye kɛla ten kɛbi waati ɲuman?» Cɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Kɛbi a denniya tumana. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Jena ka a mira ko siyaman ka a labe ta rɔ, wala ji rɔ, sa a ri a faa. Ni a se ye i yɛ ka ko do kɛ, i ye kininkinin an ma ka an dɛmɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «‹Ni i ri se a la?› A bɛɛ sɔnɔman ni i lemɛniyanin» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Den fa ka a kan nabɔ i kɔrɔ ko: «N lemɛniyanin! Kɔni n fanan sikanin. I ye n dɛmɛn n na sika wo rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Isa ka jama borimantɔ yen, a ye nala a ma. Wo rɔ, a jamanda jena ma, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Jena, ile mɛn ye mɔɔ kɛla bobo ni tolo gbɛdɛn di, n ye a fɔla i yɛ ko i ye bɔ den ɲin fɛ. I kana kɛ a fɛ butun.» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Nba, jena wo ka kule ba kɛ ka den nayɛrɛyɛrɛ fanka la ka bɔ a fɛ. Den kɛra ikomin su. Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye, woilu siyaman ka a fɔ ko den da sa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kɔni Isa ka a mira a bolo ma ka a lawuli. Den wulira ka a lɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa donda bon na. Ka a to ye, a la karandenilu ka a maɲininka ii jɛrɛ ma ko: «Nfenna andeilu ma se jena wo gbɛnna?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Mɔɔ ti se jena wo ɲɔɔn gbɛnna ɲa si ma ni Alla matara tɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la saya ni a wuli ko ka bɔ saya rɔ a ka wo fɔ ikɔ tuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Isa ni a la karandenilu bɔra ye, ka Kalile mara rataama. Isa tun tɛ a fɛ mɔɔilu ye a diya lɔn, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />baa a tɛrɛ ye a la karandenilu karanna. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri don mɔɔilu bolo. Woilu ri a faa. Kɔni tele sawanan a ri wuli.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kɔni karandenilu ma kuma wo ɲayen. Hali wo, ii ma sɔn ka Isa maɲininka a kɔrɔ ma ka a masɔrɔn ii silannin tɛrɛ.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ mɛn ye ɲɛmɔɔ ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Nba, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Kapɛrinahumu. Ka ii to bon kɔndɔ, a ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai tɛrɛ ye kumala nfen de kan sila la?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ii ka ii makun, baa mɛn ka bon tɔilu ri ii tɛma, ii tun ye i ɲɔɔn masɔsɔla wo ko rɔ sila kan. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Awa, Isa ka a sii ka ii mɔɔ tan ni fila kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka kɛ ɲɛmɔɔ ri, fɔɔ wo tii ye kɛ bɛɛ kɔmɔɔ le ri, a ni bɛɛ la baaraden.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka dennin do ta ka wo lalɔ ii tɛma, ka a mabɛrɛbɛrɛ, ka ban ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Ni mɔɔ mɛn sɔnda ka dennin ɲin ɲɔɔn mira koɲuma nde kosɔn, wo tii ra n jɛrɛ le mira wo ri. Ni mɔɔ mɛn fanan ka n mira koɲuma, wo tii ma nde gbansan mira. A ka n kelayaba le fanan mira koɲuma.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛn tɛ an juu ri, wo ye an ɲiin di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yuhana ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an ka cɛɛ do yen, mɛn ye jena gbɛnna ka a bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ i tɔɔ rɔ. An ka a fɔ a yɛ ko a ye wo boloka, baa a tɛ an na dɛkuru rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Isa ka a jabi: «Ai kana wo mɔɔ ragbɛrɛn. Baa mɔɔ si ti se ka kabannako kɛ n tɔɔ rɔ, ka ban ka kuma juu fɔ n ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Baa mɔɔ mɛn tɛ an juu ri, wo tii ye an ɲiin de ri. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: Mɔɔ mɛn ka jilafɛ ɲa kelen minninji di ai ma baa ai ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta le ri, wo tii tɛ bɔnɔ wo baarayi rɔ fewu. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Dennin mɛnilu lemɛniyanin n ma, ni mɔɔ do kɛra sababu ri ka wo kelen nafili, ni mɔɔilu ka kabakudun belebeleba sidi wo tii kan na ka a lafili kɔɔji rɔ, wo ka fisa a ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44" />Ni i bolo kelen ye kɛla sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla, i ye wo tɛɛ a la ka a bɔ ye! Baa ni i fɛtɔ donda ɲenemaya jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ, wo ka fisa i ma sani i bolofilatii wa don jahanama kɔndɔ, ta sabali ye yɔrɔ mɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.43-44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">9.44: Sɛbɛli do kuma diya binaanin ni naanin 44 sɛbɛnin yan ko: «Tunbu mɛnilu ye suilu dɔɔnna, woilu tɛ faala ye fewu. Ta fanan tɛ sala ye fewu.»</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46" />Ni i sen kelen ye kɛla sababu ri ka i lafili, i ye a tɛɛ ka a bɔ a la. Baa ni i senkelen donda ɲenemaya jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ, wo ka fisa i ma sani i senfilatii ye lafili jahanama kɔndɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.45-46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">9.46: Sɛbɛli do kuma diya binaanin ni wɔɔrɔ (46) sɛbɛnin yan ko: «Tunbu mɛnilu ye suilu dɔɔnna, woilu tɛ faala ye fewu. Ta fanan tɛ sala ye fewu.»</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ni i ɲa kelen ye kɛla sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla, i ye a labɔ. Baa ni i ɲakelentii donda Alla la mansaya rɔ, wo ka fisa i ma sani i ɲafilatii ye lafili jahanama kɔndɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />«‹Tunbu mɛnilu ye suilu dɔɔnna, woilu tɛ faala ye fewu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 9:48">Ta fanan tɛ sala ye fewu.›<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ta ri kɛ mɔɔ bɛɛ la ikomin kɔɔ ye kɛla dɔɔnnifen na ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Kɔɔ ye fen ɲuma le ri. Kɔni ni a timinya bɔra a la, nfen di se a timinyala ikɔ tuun? Fɔɔ ai ye a to kɔɔ ye kɛ ai kɔndɔ, ka a to hɛrɛ ye kɛ ai ni i ɲɔɔn tɛma.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Awa, Isa bɔra ye ka wa Jude mara rɔ Juridɛn Ba kɔma. Mɔɔ siyaman ba nara a tɛrɛn ye kokura. A ka a kɛ ii karan di ikomin a dorini a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma kɔrɔman.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Farisi doilu nara Isa tɛrɛn ye. Ii nara Isa kɔrɔbɔ kanma. Wo rɔ, ii ka a maɲininka ko: «A dahanin cɛɛ ye a muso bila wa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Musa ka ai jamari nfen na?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Musa sɔnda cɛɛ ye furusa sɛbɛ rabɛn ka a muso bila.»<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye mɔɔ muruntininilu le ri. Wo le ka a kɛ, Musa ka jamarili wo sɛbɛ ka a di ai ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kɔni dunuɲa dantɔla, Alla ka cɛɛ ni muso dan. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Wo le kosɔn, cɛɛ ri mataa a fa ni a na la, ka to a muso fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Ii fila ri kɛ mɔɔ kelen di. Wo rɔ, ii tɛ jatela mɔɔ fila ri butun fɔɔ mɔɔ kelen. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Wo le kosɔn, Alla ka mɛnilu ladɛn ka ii kɛ kelen di, mɔɔ si kana woilu fara ka ii bɔ i ɲɔɔn na.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Isa ni a la karandenilu donda bon kɔndɔ ikɔ tuun tuma mɛn na, karandenilu ka Isa maɲininka ko wo ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a muso bila ka muso gbɛrɛ furu, wo tii ra kaninkɛ. A ra a muso fɔlɔ hakɛ ta. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ni muso mɛn fanan ka a furusa a cɛɛ ma ka wa sii cɛɛ gbɛrɛ kun, muso wo ra kaninkɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa duwara denilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Mɔɔ doilu tɛrɛ ye nala denilu ri Isa ma, sa a ri a bolo la ii kan ka duwa ii yɛ. Kɔni karandenilu jamanda mɔɔilu ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Isa ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, a mɔnɛra karandenilu kanma. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye a to denilu ye na n ma. Ai kana ii ban, baa Alla la mansaya niiyɔrɔ ye ii ta le ri a ni mɛnilu ye fanan ikomin ɲinilu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ mɛn ti nala sɔnna Alla la mansaya ma ikomin dennin ye sɔnna ɲa mɛn ma, wo tii ti nala sela niiyɔrɔ sɔrɔnna Alla la mansaya rɔ muumɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka denilu ta ka ii mabɛrɛbɛrɛ ka a bolo la ii kan ka duwa ii yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cɛɛ nanfulutii la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Awa, Isa tamintɔla tuma mɛn na, cɛɛ do borimantɔ nara a ɲɔnkin a kɔrɔ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ ɲuma, n ka kan ka nfen kɛ, sa n di ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Isa ka a jabi: «Nfenna i kan n ma ko karanmɔɔ ɲuma? Mɔɔ ɲuma si tɛ ye. Alla kelen pe le ka ɲin. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />I ka Alla la sariyailu lɔn, mɛnilu ye a fɔla ko: ‹I kana mɔɔ faa, i kana kaninkɛ, i kana suɲali kɛ, i kana kɛ sere juu ri, i kana mɔɔ tɔɲɔ, i ye i fa ni i na bonya.›» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Cɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, n ka woilu bɛɛ labato kɛbi n denninya tumana.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Isa ka a ragbɛ. A diyara Isa yɛ. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ko kelen dɛsɛnin i ma fɔlɔ. Wa i bolofenilu bɛɛ fɛrɛ ka a wodi ratala fantanilu tɛma. Wo rɔ, nanfulu ba ri kɛ i bolo sankolo rɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, i ye na i bila n kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Kuma wo ka cɛɛ jusu tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ. A niilafinnin wulira ka wa, baa a bolofen ka siya.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Wo kɛnin, Isa ka a kɔfɛnɛ ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Nanfulutii don Alla la mansaya rɔ, wo gbɛlɛnman de!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Kuma wo ka karandenilu kabannakoya. Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «N denilu, ka don Alla la mansaya rɔ, wo gbɛlɛnman de! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ɲɔɔmɛ don duman sɛlan woo la ka tamin nanfulutii don ko rɔ Alla la mansaya rɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Karandenilu kabannakoyara ikɔ tuun fɔɔ ka a dan natamin. Ii tɛrɛ a fɔla i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Yon di se kisila wo rɔ sa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Isa ka ii ragbɛ ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ ti se wo kɛla, kɔni Alla ri se; baa Alla ri se ko bɛɛ kɛla.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Wo rɔ, Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Andeilu don? Andeilu ra fen bɛɛ to ye ka an bila i kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Isa ka a jabi: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a la bon to ye, wala a dɔɔilu ni a kɔrɔilu, wala a na, wala a fa, wala a denilu, wala a la sɛnɛ, nde la ko kosɔn, a ni kibaro ɲuma la ko kosɔn, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />wo tii ri woilu ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100) sɔrɔn dunuɲa ɲin dɔ yan. A ri bonilu sɔrɔn, a ni dɔɔilu ni kɔrɔilu ni nailu ni denilu ni sɛnɛilu. A ri magbɔya fanan sɔrɔn. Sininnatɔ, a ri ɲenemaya banbali fanan sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kɔni ɲɛmɔɔ siyaman di kɛ kɔmɔɔilu ri. Kɔmɔɔ siyaman di kɛ ɲɛmɔɔilu ri fanan.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la saya ni a la wuli ko ka bɔ saya rɔ ko fɔ ikɔ tuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Isa ni a la karandenilu tɛrɛ ye sila kan, ii watɔ Jerusalɛmu. Isa tɛrɛ ye ɲɛfɛ. A la karandenilu kabannakoyara. Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ii kɔ, woilu silannin tɛrɛ. Isa ka a la talibidenba tan ni fila ta ka wa ii ri ii dan na ikɔ tuun. Ko mɛn kɛtɔ a sɔrɔnna, a ka wo fɔ ii yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />«Ai tolo malɔ, an watɔ Jerusalɛmu. Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri don Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu bolo. Woilu ri kiti labe a kan a ka kan ka faa. Ii ri a don siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu bolo. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Woilu ri a lafɛya, ka ii daji kɛ a kan, ka a gbasi gbiɲɛ la, ka a faa. Kɔni tele sawanan tamin kɔ, a ri wuli ikɔ tuun.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuba ni Yuhana ka Isa madiya mɛn kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Yakuba ni Yuhana, Sebede dencɛ fila, ka ii madon Isa la ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an wa i tara mɛn na, an ye a fɛ i ye wo kɛ an yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye a fɛ n ye nfen kɛ ai yɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ii ka a jabi: «I wa kɛ mansa gbiliyanin di, i ye a to an mɔɔ kelen ye a sii i bolokinin ma, do ri a sii i bolomaran ma.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Kɔni Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye ko mɛn tarala, ai ma wo kɔrɔ lɔn. Tɔrɔya mɛn kɛtɔ n sɔrɔnna, ai ri se wo muɲunna wa? N di sun tɔrɔya rɔ ikomin mɔɔilu ye sunna ji rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Ai ri se sunna wo ɲa ma wa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «An di se a kɔrɔ.» Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N di sɔn tɔrɔya mɛn ma, ai fanan di sɔn wo ma. N di sun tɔrɔya rɔ ɲa mɛn ma, ai fanan di sun ten. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kɔni sii diya mɛnilu ye n bolokinin ni n bolomaran ma, nde ti woilu diba ri. Alla ka sii diya woilu rabɛn mɔɔ mɛnilu yɛ, a ri ii di woilu ma.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Talibiden tɔ tan ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, woilu mɔnɛra Yakuba ni Yuhana kanma. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Wo rɔ, Isa ka ii kili, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ka a lɔn ko mɔɔilu ye mɛnilu jatela jamana mansailu ri, woilu le ye kuntiiya kɛla ii la jamanadenilu kan diyagboya la. Jamana mɔɔbailu ri fanka la jamanadenilu kan. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kɔni a ma kan ka kɛ ten ai tɛma. Mɛn ye a fɛ ka kɛ mɔɔba ri ai rɔ, wo tii ka kan ka kɛ ai la baaraden di. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mɛn ye a fɛ ka kɛ ai rɔ ɲɛmɔɔ ri, wo tii ye kɛ ai bɛɛ la jɔn di. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Baa Mɔɔ Dencɛ ma na dunuɲa rɔ ko mɔɔilu ye baara kɛ a yɛ. A jɛrɛ nara baara kan de ma, a ni ka a nii di ka kɛ mɔɔ siyaman kunka sara ri.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲa funyen do ɲa laka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Jeriko so kɔndɔ. Ii ni jama ba bɔtɔla so kɔndɔ, ɲa funyen do siinin sila da la ka tarali kɛ. Wo tɔɔ ko Baritime. A fa tɔɔ ko Time. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />A ka a mɛn mɛn kɛ ko Isa Nasarɛtika le taminna, a ka a kan nabɔ damira ko: «Isa, Dawuda dencɛ, i ye kininkinin n ma.» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mɔɔ siyaman ka a makuma ko: «I makun.» Kɔni a ka a kan nabɔ ka tamin fɔlɔmanna ka a fɔ ko: «Dawuda dencɛ, i ye kininkinin n ma.»<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Isa ka a lɔ ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye a kili.» Mɔɔilu wara ɲa funyen kili ko: «I jusulatɛɛ. I wuli. Isa ye i kilila.»<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Wo rɔ, cɛɛ ka a la durukiba lafili duu ma ka a wuli i kɔrɔkɔrɔ, ka wa Isa tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Isa ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye a fɛ n ye nfen de kɛ i yɛ?» Cɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, n ye a fɛ i ye n ɲa laka.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Wa. I la lemɛniya ra i lakɛndɛya.» A ɲa lakara i kɔrɔ. A ka a bila Isa kɔfɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Isa donda Jerusalɛmu fali den kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Awa, Isa ni a kɔmɔɔilu sudunyara Jerusalɛmu, ka se Olibiye Koyinkɛ ma. Yɔrɔ wo ma jan Bɛtifase ni Betani soilu la. Ka ii to ye, Isa ka a la karanden mɔɔ fila kelaya. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «So mɛsɛn mɛn ye ai ɲɛfɛ wo ri, ai ye wa ye. Ai wa don so kɔndɔ, ai ri fali den bulan do sidinin yen i kɔrɔ, mɔɔ ma a sii mɛn kan fɔlɔ. Ai ye a fulen ka na a ri yan. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ni mɔɔ do ka ai maɲininka ko nfenna ai ye a fulenna, ai ye wo tii jabi: ‹Maari le mako ye a la. A tɛ mɛn bakɛ, a ri a lasɛ yan.›»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Karanden fila woilu wara ka fali den do sidinin tɛrɛn bon do dala sila dala. Ii ka a fulen. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ye, wo doilu ka karandenilu maɲininka ko: «Ai ye nfen de kɛla ɲin di ten? Nfenna ai ye fali den fulenna?»<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Karandenilu ka ii jabi ikomin Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Wo rɔ, mɔɔ woilu ka fali den to ii bolo ko ii ye wa a ri. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Karandenilu nara fali ri Isa ma. Ii ka ii la durukibailu la fali kɔ kan. Isa yɛlɛra ka a sii a kan. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Mɔɔ siyaman ka ii la durukibailu fɛnsɛn sila kan Isa ɲɛfɛ. Doilu ka jiribolon mɛsɛnilu fɛnsɛn sila kan a ɲɛfɛ, ii tun ka mɛnilu tɛɛ tɛɛ waa rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ Isa ɲɛfɛ a ni mɛnilu tɛrɛ a kɔfɛ, woilu tɛrɛ ii kan ba labɔla ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">«Tandoli ye kɛ Alla yɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">Mɛn ye nala Maari tɔɔ rɔ ten,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">Alla ye baraka don wo rɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />An benba Dawuda la mansaya mɛn natɔ ɲin di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">Alla ye baraka don wo rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">Tandoli ye kɛ Alla yɛ sankolo rɔ!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Wo rɔ Isa donnin Jerusalɛmu, a wara Alla batobonba la ka fen bɛɛ ragbɛ ye. Wo kɔ rɔ, a wara Betani, a ni a la talibidenba tan ni fila, baa su tun da ko.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka toroju danka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Wo duu sa gbɛni, ii bɔtɔla Betani, kɔnkɔ ka Isa mira. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />A ka toroju do yen yɔrɔ jan. Fira tɛrɛ ye a la. A wara ka a ragbɛ ni toroden do ri sɔrɔn a la. Kɔni a sera toroju kɔrɔ tuma mɛn na, a ma den si sɔrɔn a la fɔɔ fira gbansan, baa a den waati tun ma se fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Wo rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ toroju yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ si kana den sɔrɔn i la butun ka a dɔɔn.» A la karandenilu ka kuma wo mɛn.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka julailu gbɛn ka bɔ Alla batobonba kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Jerusalɛmu tuma mɛn na, Isa donda Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ. A ka jula ni sanninkɛla mɛnilu tɛrɛn lu kɔndɔ ye, a wulira woilu gbɛnna ka ii labɔ ye. A ka wodifalennailu la tabaliilu labe, ka kanba julailu la siifenilu fanan nabe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />A ma sɔn mɔɔ si ye Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ rataama sanninfenilu ri. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />A ka ye mɔɔilu karan ko: «A sɛbɛnin tɛ Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ ko: ‹N na bon di kɛ siyailu bɛɛ la Alla tara diya ri?› Kɔni ai ra a kɛ benkaninnailu dokon diya ri.»<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ka ko woilu mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii ka fɛrɛ ɲinin damira ka a faa. Ii silannin a yɛ ka a masɔrɔn a la karan tɛrɛ ye jama bɛɛ kun mirala.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Su kora tuma mɛn na, Isa ni a la karandenilu bɔra so kɔndɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔilu karan Alla matara ɲa la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Wo duu sa gbɛ sɔɔma da la, Isa ni a la karandenilu tamintɔla, ii ka toroju wo yen, a janin fɔɔ ka se a luluniilu ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Isa tun ka mɛn fɔ, Piyɛri hankili bilara wo rɔ. A ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, a ragbɛ! I ka toroju mɛn danka, a ra ja.»<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye lemɛniya Alla ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ do ka a fɔ koyinkɛ ɲin yɛ ko; ‹i ye bɔ i nɔ rɔ ka wa be kɔɔji rɔ.› Ni wo tii ma sika don a jusu rɔ fewu fɔɔ ka la a la ko ko wo ri kɛ ikomin a ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma, a ri kɛ ten a yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Wo le kosɔn, n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko ai wa Alla matara mɛn na, ai ye la a la ko ai ra wo sɔrɔn, wo rɔ ai ri wo sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ka ai lɔnin to Alla tarala, ni ai hankili bilara ko mɔɔ do ka ai hakɛ ta, ai ye yafa wo tii ma, sa ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ ri ai fanan na kojuuilu makoto.» <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuma ɲin ka funin suran ɲin dɔ le. A sɛbɛnin tɛ kitabu fɔlɔman dɔ ko: «Kɔni, ni ai ma yafa ai mɔɔɲɔɔ ma, ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ wo ti yafa ai ma de.»</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu ma sɔn Isa la sebaya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Jerusalɛmu ikɔ tuun. Ka Isa to a mataamataamala Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu nara Isa tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye baara mɛn kɛla ɲin di, yon ka i lɔ wo la? I ye yon na se kɔrɔ?»<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Isa ka ii jabi: «N di ai maɲininka ko kelen ma. Ai wa n jabi, n di a fɔ ai yɛ mɛn ka n lɔ baara ɲin kɛla. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yon de ka Yaya lɔ mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ? Alla le ka a lɔ wa, wala mɔɔilu? Ai ye n jabi.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Ni an ka a fɔ ko: ‹Alla le ka Yaya lɔ›, a ri a fɔ an yɛ ko: ‹nfenna ai ma la a la kuma la?› <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kɔni, ni an ka a jabi ɲa gbɛrɛ ma: ‹Mɔɔilu ma› wo ye di?» (Ii silannin jama yɛ baa mɔɔ bɛɛ ka i miri ko Yaya tɛrɛ ye keladen fisamante le ri.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Wo rɔ, ii ka Isa jabi: «An ma a lɔn.» Isa fanan ka ii jabi: «Nba, ni wo le, n tɛna a fɔla ai yɛ mɛn ka n lɔ baara ɲin kɛla.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Kuma kɔrɔlama rɛsɛnfɛ tii juuilu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Awa, Isa ka ii karan damira kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Cɛɛ do ka rɛsɛnfɛ do labɔ ka a laminin sansan na. A ka denka sen, mɛn di kɛ rɛsɛnji bɔ diya ri. A ka gbala mayɛlɛnin do fanan lɔ, mɛn di kɛ sɛnɛ kɔnɔgbɛn diya ri. A bannin wo bɛɛ la, a ka rɛsɛnfɛ karifa sɛnɛkɛla doilu. Wo kɔ rɔ, a wara taama rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Rɛsɛnden kadi waati sera tuma mɛn na, a ka a la jɔn do lawa sɛnɛkɛlailu ma, ko ii ye a niiyɔrɔ di a ma rɛsɛnden kadiniilu rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kɔni jɔn sera ye tuma mɛn na, sɛnɛkɛlailu ka a mira ka a gbasi, ka a bololakolon nawa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Rɛsɛnfɛ tii ka jɔn gbɛrɛ lawa ii ma ikɔ tuun. Ii ka wo gbasi a kun dɔ, ka a nanin. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Rɛsɛnfɛ tii ka jɔn gbɛrɛ lawa ii ma ikɔ tuun. Ii ka wo faa. Rɛsɛnfɛ tii ka jɔn siyaman gbɛrɛilu lawa kelen kelen. Sɛnɛkɛlailu ka doilu gbasi, ka doilu faa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mɔɔ kelen mɛn tora rɛsɛnfɛ tii bolo, wo tɛrɛ ye a dencɛ ri, mɛn duman a yɛ kosɛbɛ. A laban, a ka wo lawa sɛnɛkɛlailu ma, baa a ka a miri ko: ‹Ii ri a dencɛ bonya.› <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kɔni sɛnɛkɛlailu ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: ‹Cɛtala le ɲin di. Ai ye na, an ye wa a faa. Ni an ka a faa, cɛ ri kɛ an ta ri.› <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Wo rɔ, ii ka a mira ka a faa, ka a su lafili kɔkan.»<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «A ye di wo rɔ? Rɛsɛnfɛ tii ri nfen kɛ sɛnɛkɛla woilu la? A ri wa sɛnɛkɛlailu halaki ka rɛsɛnfɛ karifa mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu la. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10-11" />A sɛbɛnin Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10-11">«‹Bon lɔlailu ka ii ban kabakudun mɛn dɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10-11">wo le kɛla bon jusii kabakudun di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10-11">Maari nɔ le wo ri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10-11">A kɛra an ɲana kabannako ri.›</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:10-11">Ai ma wo karan fɔlɔ wa?»<verse eid="MRK 12:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ii tun ye a fɛ ka Isa mira, baa ii ka a ɲayen ko a ka kuma kɔrɔlama wo fɔ iile le ma. Kɔni ii silanda jama yɛ. Wo rɔ, ii ka Isa to ye ka wa.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niisɔnkɔ bɔ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Judiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka Farisi doilu ni mansa Herodi kɔmɔɔ doilu lawa Isa ma, sa ii ri a mira sababu sɔrɔn a jɛrɛ da rɔ kuma doilu fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ii nara a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an ka a lɔn ko i ye kankelentii le ri. I tɛ silanna mɔɔ si ɲɛ, i tɛ mɔɔ lafisayala mɔɔ ma fanan. Alla la sila ka kan ka taama ɲa mɛn, i ye mɔɔilu karanna wo la tuɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ. A ye di wo rɔ? Ka niisɔnkɔ bɔ ka a di Romu mansa Sesari ma, wo bɛnnin an ma wa, wala wo bɛnnin tɛ? An ka kan ka wo sara wa, wala wo ma kan ka sara?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kɔni Isa ka a ɲayen ko filanfilanteilu le. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye n ɲaɲininna? Ai ye na wodi gbanan kelen di n ma, n ye a ragbɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ii nara wodi gbanan kelen di Isa ma. A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Yon munuɲa ni yon tɔɔ ye gbanan ɲin kan?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Romu mansa Sesari.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Nba, ai ye mansa Sesari la fen di mansa Sesari ma. Ai ye Alla fanan ta di Alla ma.» Isa la jabili ka ii kabannakoya.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadusiilu ka ɲininkali kɛ Isa kun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Awa, Sadusi doilu (mɛnilu ka a fɔ ko mɔɔ ti wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ) woilu le nara Isa tɛrɛn, ka a maɲininka ko: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Karanmɔɔ, Musa ka a sɛbɛ a la sariya rɔ ko ni i nakelenɲɔɔ do sara ka a muso densɔrɔnbali to ye, i ye muso wo ta sa a ri den sɔrɔn i nakelenɲɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Awa, dencɛ wɔrɔnwula tɛrɛ ye cɛɛ do bolo. Dencɛ fɔlɔ ka muso do furu. A sara ka a muso densɔrɔnbali to ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Dencɛ filana ka muso wo ta. A fanan sara ka muso densɔrɔnbali to ye. Dencɛ sawana fanan ta kɛra ten. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />A kɛra ten haan muso wo siira kanberen wɔrɔnwula kelen kelenna bɛɛ kun ma. Ii bɛɛ sara ka muso densɔrɔnbali to ye. Wo kɔ, muso fanan sara. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />A ye di? Su lawuli lon, muso ri kɛ yon ta ri? A siira ii kelen kelenna bɛɛ kun ma.»<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ma Alla la Kitabu kɔrɔ famun. Ai ma foyi lɔn Alla la sebaya ko rɔ fanan. Wo le ka a kɛ, ai filini! <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Baa suilu wa wuli saya rɔ, cɛɛ tɛna muso furula, muso fanan tɛna siila cɛɛ kun ma. Ii bɛɛ ri kɛ ikomin sankolo rɔ mɛlɛkailu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Su lawuli ko fan fɛ, Musa ka jiri tunin tariku mɛn sɛbɛ Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ, ai ma wo karan wa? Alla tora jiri tuni rɔ ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: ‹N ye i benba Iburahima Maari le ri, a ni i benba Isiyaka ta, a ni i benba Yakuba ta.› <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Alla tɛ suilu Maari ri. Ɛɛn de! A ye mɔɔ ɲenemailu Maari le ri. Wo le kosɔn, ai filini kojuuya.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya mɛn gbɛlɛnman tɔilu ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Sariya karanmɔɔ do ka Isa ni mɔɔ woilu la sɔsɔli kan mɛn. A ka a yen ko Isa ka ii jabi a ɲumala. Wo rɔ, a ka Isa maɲininka ko: «Alla la sariya ɲuman ɲatɔnɔ ka bon tɔilu bɛɛ ri?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Isa ka a jabi: «Sariya mɛn ɲatɔnɔ ka bon tɔilu bɛɛ ri, wo le ɲin di: ‹Ai Isirayɛlikailu, ai ye ai tolo malɔ: Maari Alla ye an na Alla le ri. Maari Alla kelen pe le ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Fɔɔ i ye i la Maari Alla kanin i jusukun bɛɛ rɔ, a ni i sɔnɔmɛ bɛɛ rɔ, a ni i miriya bɛɛ rɔ, a ni i fanka bɛɛ rɔ.› <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Sariya mɛn tuunni wo la, ale le ɲin di: ‹I ye i mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin i ye i jɛrɛ.› Sariya tɛ ye, mɛn ka bon sariya fila ɲinilu ri.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Sariya karanmɔɔ ka a fɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i ra jabili kɛ koɲuma. I ka a fɔ ko Alla kelen pe le ye, ko Alla gbɛrɛ si tɛ ye ale kɔ. I jo ye wo rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mɔɔ ka kan ka a kanin a jusukun bɛɛ rɔ, a ni a la miriya bɛɛ, a ni a fanka bɛɛ, ka a mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin a jɛrɛ. Wo ka bon saraka su bɛɛ bɔ ri Alla yɛ, hali mɛn di kannatɛɛ ka janin ka kɛ buuri ri.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Isa ka a yen mɛn kɛ ko cɛɛ wo ra jabili kɛ famunyali la, a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ma jan Alla la mansaya la.» Ka a taa waati wo ma, mɔɔ si ma jusulatɛɛ sɔrɔn butun ka Isa maɲininka ko si ma.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la Mɔɔ Suwandini ye mansa Dawuda la maari le ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Nba, ka Isa to mɔɔilu karanna Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ, a ka mɔɔilu maɲininka ko: «Nfenna sariya karanmɔɔilu ye a fɔla ko Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye Dawuda bɔnsɔn de ri? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Alla Nii Sɛniman ka a kɛ Dawuda jɛrɛ ka a fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">«‹Maari Alla ka a fɔ n na maari yɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">«Na i sii n bolokinin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">haan n wa ban i juuilu bilala i sen kɔrɔ.»›<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Awa, ni Dawuda jɛrɛ ye Alla la Mɔɔ Suwandini kilila ko a la Maari, a don di se kɛla a bɔnsɔn di di?» Jama ba tɛrɛ ye ii tolo malɔla Isa la ka sɛwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka sariya karanmɔɔilu jalaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ka a to karanna, a ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye ai jɛrɛ kɔrɔsi sariya karanmɔɔilu ma de! A duman ii yɛ ka duruki ba don ka yaalayaala ikomin mɔɔbailu. Ii ye a fɛ mɔɔilu ye ii fo jamama yɔrɔilu rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Ni ii donda salibon na, wala ni ii kilira dɔɔnnin diya, ii ye a fɛ ka ii sii mɔɔbailu la sii diyailu rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ii ye cɛsamusoilu bolofenilu bɛɛ bɔla ii bolo. Ii ye mɛnna Alla matarala sa mɔɔilu ri ii yen ka ii bonya. Nba, Alla ri kiti labe ii kan, mɛn di juuya mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu ta ko.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muso fantan ka wodi mɛn bɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Isa ka a sii Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ ka a ɲasin wodi bila diya la. Ka mɔɔilu to wodi bilala ye, a ka ii di ɲa ragbɛ. Nanfulutii siyaman ka wodi ba bila ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />A ka muso fantan do fanan yen, mɛn cɛɛ sanin. Wo nara ka daɲa gbanan mɛsɛn fila bila wodi bila diya rɔ. Wodi wo ma siya fewu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Isa ka a la karandenilu kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: muso fantan wo, mɛn cɛɛ sanin, a ra wodi mɛn bila wodi bila diya, wo ka bon tɔilu bɛɛ ta ri. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Baa ii bɛɛ ka dɔɔnin de bɔ ii la nanfulu rɔ ka wo di. Kɔni ka muso wo to fantanya rɔ, a ka a la wodi bɛɛ le di. Foyi ma to a bolo, hali a balo.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka Alla batobonba te ko fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Nba, Isa bɔ mɛn kɛnin Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ, a la karanden do ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, a ragbɛ! Alla batobonba lɔnin kabakudun dagbɛlɛn bailu le la! A bonilu ka ɲin ba le!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Isa ka a jabi: «I ɲa ye bon ba mɛnilu la ten, lon do rɔ ɲin bɛɛ ri te, ka a kabakudunilu bɛɛ jɛnsɛn ka a bɔ i ɲɔɔn kan.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ka Isa siinin to Olibiye Koyinkɛ kan ka a ɲasin Alla batobonba la, Piyɛri ni Yakuba ni Yuhana ni Andere nara a maɲininka diya ii dan na. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i kan ye ko mɛnilu ma, woilu ri kɛ waati ɲuman? Tɔɔmasere su ɲuman di a yiraka ko waati wo ra se?»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ sa mɔɔ si kana ai lafili. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mɔɔ siyaman di na n tɔɔ rɔ, ka a fɔ ko: ‹Nde le.› Ii ri mɔɔ siyaman nafili wo rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ni a fɔra ai ɲana ko kɛlɛ kɛnin yɔrɔ do rɔ, wala ko kɛlɛ kuma wa lamɛn, wo kana bara ai rɔ ka ai masilan. Fɔɔ ko woilu ye kɛ, kɔni wo tɛna kɛ dunuɲa laban di fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Siya ri wuli siya gbɛrɛ kanma. Mansayala do ri wuli dogbɛrɛ kanma. Duukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛ ri kɛ yɔrɔ doilu rɔ. Kɔnkɔ bailu fanan di don. Ko woilu ye tɔrɔya damira le ri, ikomin tinkɔnɔdimin ye muso moyitɔla mirala ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />«Nba, ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ. Mɔɔilu ri ai mira ka wa ai ri jamana kititɛɛlailu wara. Mɔɔilu ri ai gbasi gbiɲɛ la Judiyailu la salibonilu kɔndɔ. Mɔɔilu ri wa ai ri jamana ɲɛmɔɔilu ni mansailu wara ka a masɔrɔn ai ye n ta ri. Wo ri kɛ sababu ri ai ri kɛ n sere ri ii ɲana. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Fɔlɔ, fɔɔ kibaro ɲuma ye lase siyailu bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="MRK 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />«Mɔɔilu wa ai mira ko ii watɔ ai ri kititɛɛ diya, ai ri mɛn fɔ ye, ai kana hamin wo la fɔlɔ. Kuma wa di ai ma waati wo jɛrɛ rɔ, ai ye wo fɔ. Baa ai tɛ nala kumala ai kelen na. Ɛɛn de, Alla Nii Sɛniman di kumailu don ai da rɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />«Mɔɔ ri a badenma don mɔɔilu bolo kosa ii ri a faa. Fa fanan di wo ɲɔɔn kɛ a den na. Mɔɔilu ri kɛ ii sɔrɔnbailu juuilu ri ka kɛ sababu ri mɔɔilu ri woilu faa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ai ri gboya mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ n tɔɔ kosɔn. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa a muɲun fɔɔ a laban, wo tii ri kisi.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya ri se Jerusalɛmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Ai ri Fen Haramunnin yen, wo mɛn gboman Alla yɛ kojuuya. A ma kan ka kɛ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, ai ri a lɔnin ye yen. (Mɛnilu ye sɛbɛ ɲin karanna, fɔɔ ii ye wo famun.) Ni waati wo sera, mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Jude mara rɔ, woilu ye ii bori ka wa koyinkɛilu kan. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ni waati wo ka mɔɔ mɛn tɛrɛn bon kun bilinin kan, wo tii kana jii ka don bon kɔndɔ ko a ye fen do tala. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Wo wa mɔɔ mɛn tɛrɛn sɛnɛ rɔ, wo tii kana a kɔsɛ a wara ko a ye a la durukiba tala. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Waati wo la, muso kɔnɔmailu ri tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ, a ni muso denba tiilu. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ai ye Alla matara, sa ko woilu ti nala kɛla nɛnɛ tuma rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Baa lon woilu kɔrɔ, tɔrɔya ri gbɛlɛnya kojuuya. Wo ɲɔɔn ma kɛ fɔlɔ kɛbi Alla ka dunuɲa dan waati mɛn na fɔɔ ka na se bi ma. A don tɔrɔya wo ɲɔɔn tɛ nala kɛla butun. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ni Maari tun ma a latɛɛ ka tɔrɔya waati wo lasudunya, mɔɔ si tun tɛ nala bɔla a rɔ. Kɔni a ra a latɛɛ ka waati wo lasudunya a la mɔɔ suwandininilu la ko kosɔn. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Wo tuma, ni mɔɔ do ka a fɔ ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye yan, wala a ye ye, ai kana la a la. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Baa wuyafɔlailu ri wuli, mɛnilu wa a fɔ ko ii ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, wala Alla la keladen fisamante. Woilu ri tɔɔmasereilu ni kabannakoilu kɛ, sa a ri Alla la mɔɔ suwandininilu lafili, ni wo ri se kɛla. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Wo rɔ, ai ye a kɛ koɲuma. N da woilu bɛɛ fɔ ai yɛ sani ii ye kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ Dencɛ na ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Nba, waati wo la, tɔrɔya woilu taminnin kɔ, tele ri fin, karo ti nala kɛnɛ bɔla butun. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Loloilu ri bebe ka bɔ sankolo rɔ. Sankolo kɔndɔ fankatiilu ri juujuu ka bɔ ii nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Wo tuma, ii ri Mɔɔ Dencɛ natɔla yen duru rɔ sebaya ba la, a ni nɔɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />A ri a la mɛlɛkailu kelaya ka wa telebe ni telebɔ rɔ, a ni tele kankan bolomaran ni tele kankan bolokinin dɔ, ka a la mɔɔ suwandininilu ladɛn. Ii ri woilu ladɛn ka a bɔ dunuɲa kun do la fɔɔ ka wa se a kun do fanan na.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Toroju la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Ai ye toroju lakɔrɔsi. Ai wa a bolonilu yen naronna ka fira kurailu labɔ, ai ri a lɔn ko sama ra wuli donna. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, ni ai ka ko ɲinilu kɛtɔla yen tuma mɛn na, ai ri a lɔn ko wo waati ra sudunya, fɔdiya a ra se. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: sani bi mɔɔilu ye ban sala, ko ɲinilu bɛɛ ri ban kɛla. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Lon do rɔ, sankolo ni duukolo ri ban ka tunun fewu. Kɔni n na kuma tɛ tamin habadan!<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ si ma dunuɲa laban waati lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Ko ɲinilu ri kɛ waati mɛn na a ni lon mɛn na, mɔɔ si ma wo lɔn. Hali harijeene mɛlɛkailu a ni Alla Dencɛ jɛrɛ ma a lɔn, fɔɔ Fa Alla kelen pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ai ye a kɛ koɲuma; ai ye to ai ɲana. Ai ma ko woilu kɛ waati lɔn.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Nba, a kɛnin ikomin cɛɛ mɛn watɔ taama rɔ. Cɛɛ wo ri bɔ bon na ka bonkɔndɔ koɲailu bɛɛ karifa a la jɔnilu la, bɛɛ ni a la baara. A ri a fɔ bonda la kɔrɔsiba yɛ ko a ye to a ɲana. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Wo le rɔ, ai fanan ye to ai ɲana, baa ai ma a lɔn bontii ri na waati mɛn. A ri na wura la, wala duu talama, wala dondon kasi waati, wala sɔɔma da la, ai ma wo lɔn. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />A kana na bara ai rɔ ka ai tɛrɛn sunɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />N ye mɛn fɔla ai yɛ ɲin di, n ye wo fɔla mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ: ko ai ye to ai ɲana.»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu ka ii ɲɔɔn yen Isa janfa kanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Nba, a tun da to tele fila Taminkunna Sali ri kɛ, a ni Buru Fununbali Sali. Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu tɛrɛ a ɲa ɲininna ka Isa mira dokon dɔ ka a faa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Baa ii tɛrɛ a fɔla ko: «An kana a mira sali waati la; ni wo tɛ, mɔɔilu ri wuli ka murunti.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muso do ka tulu sumaduman kɛ Isa kun dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Awa, Isa tɛrɛ ye tola Betani so kɔndɔ, Simɔn Kunatɔ wara. Ka a siinin to dɔɔnnin diya, muso do wulira ka na daa alabasitari ri, mɛn fanin latikɔlɔn tulu dagbɛlɛnna. Latikɔlɔn tulu tɔɔ ko naridi. Muso wo ka daa rate ka latikɔlɔn tulu mun Isa kun ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wo ka mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛn ye, doilu mɔnɛra ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Nfenna muso ɲin da latikɔlɔn tulu tiɲan ten? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Tulu ɲin tun di se feerela wodi gbanan kɛmɛ sawa (300) la, ka wodi wo kɛ fantanilu dɛmɛnfen di.» Ii ka muso majaman kojuuya. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye muso to ye! Nfenna ai ye a tɔrɔla? A ra koɲuma kɛ n yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Baa fantanilu ye ai fɛ waati bɛɛ. Ni waati waati ka ai diya, ai ri se ka ii dɛmɛn. Kɔni n ti nala tola ai fɛ yan haan waati bɛɛ de. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Muso ka a se ko le kɛ n yɛ. A ka latikɔlɔn tulu mun n fari ma ka a rabɛn su don kanma sani wo waati ye se. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ, kibaro ɲuma wa lase mɔɔilu ma yɔrɔ yɔrɔ dunuɲa rɔ yan, muso ka mɛn kɛ ɲin di, wo fanan di fɔ ye, sa mɔɔilu hankili ri to a le rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi ka Isa don a juuilu bolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Wo kɔrɔ, Judasi Sikariyɔti mɛn tɛrɛ ye Isa la talibidenba tan ni fila do ri, wo wara Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu tɛrɛn ye, ko a le ri Isa don ii bolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Kuma wo diyara ii yɛ. Ii ka lahidi ta Judasi yɛ ko ii ri wodi di a ma. Wo le rɔ, Judasi ka fɛrɛ ɲinin ka Isa don ii bolo.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ni a la karandenilu ka Taminkunna Sali kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nba, Judiyailu dorinin saadenilu kannatɛɛla ka ii kɛ Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin di Buru Fununbali Sali lon fɔlɔ rɔ. Wo rɔ, Isa la karandenilu ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye a fɛ an ye Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin dabɛn i yɛ min?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Isa ka a la karanden fila kelaya, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa so kɔndɔ. Ai ri bɛn cɛɛ do ri ye, ji ye daa rɔ a kun ma. Ai ye ai bila a kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Cɛɛ wo wa don bon mɛn na, ai ye a fɔ bontii wo yɛ ko: ‹Karanmɔɔ ka a fɔ ko: «N ni n na karandenilu ri Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin kɛ bon mɛn na, wo ye min?»› <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Cɛɛ wo ri bon ba do yiraka ai la sankaso sanma, mɛn dabɛnnin koɲuma. An mako ye fen mɛnilu la, woilu bɛɛ ri tɛrɛn ye. Ai ye dɔɔnninta wo rabɛn an yɛ ye.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Karandenilu bɔra ye ka wa so kɔndɔ. Ii senin ye, ii ka a tɛrɛn ikomin Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Ii ka Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnninta rabɛn ye.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Fitiri waati, Isa ni a la talibidenba tan ni fila sera ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Kɔ fɛ, ka ii siinin to dɔɔnninna, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ai rɔ kelen di n janfa ka n don mɔɔjuuilu bolo. Wo tii ye dɔɔnnin kɛla n fɛ yan.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Karandenilu niilafinda kuma wo kosɔn. Ii bɛɛ ka a fɔ a yɛ kelen kelen ko: «I kan tɛ nde ma, ko di?»<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Wo tii ye ai mɔɔ tan ni fila rɔ. A ye a bolo bilala muran kelen kɔndɔ n fɛ dɔɔnnin diya yan. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Baa Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri faa ikomin a sɛbɛnin a la ko rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn di a janfa ka a don mɔɔjuuilu bolo, gbalo ye wo tii yɛ! Hali ni wo tii sɔrɔnbali tun tora, wo tun ka fisa a ma paaɔn.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maari la dɔɔnninta la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nba, ka ii to dɔɔnninna Isa ka buru ta ka baraka bila Alla yɛ. A ka buru rakadikadi, ka a di ii ma ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ɲin mira ka a dɔɔn. N fari le ɲin di.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka jilafɛ ta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rɛsɛnji ye jilafɛ kɔndɔ. </char></note>, ka baraka bila Alla yɛ, ka ban ka jilafɛ di ii ma. Ii bɛɛ ka do min a rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N jeli le ɲin di, mɛn ye teriya jeli ri. A bɔnnin mɔɔ siyaman yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ. N ti nala rɛsɛnji minna butun fewu, fɔɔ n wa a kura min lon mɛn na Alla la mansaya rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Awa, ii ka kalaman bɔ, ka ban ka wa Olibiye Koyinkɛ kan.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a fɔ ko Piyɛri ri a fɔ ko a ma a lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Wo tuma, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ri n bila ka ai bori, baa a sɛbɛnin ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">«N di saagbɛnna gbasi ka a faa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">saailu bɛɛ ri jɛnsɛn.<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />«Kɔni ni n wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ, n di wa ai makɔnɔ Kalile mara rɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Hali ni tɔilu bɛɛ ka i bila ka i bori, n kɔni ti nala i bilala muumɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Isa ka a jabi: «N di tuɲa fɔ i yɛ: bi su ɲin dɔ jɛrɛjɛrɛ, sani dondon ye kasi siɲa fila, i ri a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ fɔɔ siɲa sawa ko i ma n lɔn.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kɔni Piyɛri ka a fɔ ka a magbɛlɛnya kosɛbɛ ko: «Hali ni ile faara, n fanan di faa wo waati kelenna, n tɛ a fɔ habadan ko n ma i lɔn.» Talibiden tɔilu bɛɛ fanan kan ten.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Alla matara Kɛtisemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Nba, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Kɛtisemani. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai sii yan fɔɔ n wa ban Alla matarala.»<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />A ka Piyɛri ni Yakuba ni Yuhana kili ko ii ye wa a malɔ. Silan ba ka a mira damira a ni a jusu tɔrɔra kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Jusukasi ra wara n ma. A ye ikomin n satɔ le. Ai ye n makɔnɔ yan ka to ai ɲana.»<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />A wara ɲɛfɛ dɔɔnin, ka a be duu ma. A ka Alla matara ko ni a tɛrɛ ri bɛn, tɔrɔya waati ɲin tɛrɛ ye a masɛ ale la. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />A ka a fɔ ko: «Baba, n Fa, i ri se ko bɛɛ kɛla. I ye nii ɲakankatan minninfen ɲin masɛ n na. Kɔni n jɛrɛ sawo kana kɛ fɔɔ i sawo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a kɔsɛ ka wa talibidenba sawa tɛrɛn. Ii ye sunɔɔ rɔ. A ka a fɔ Piyɛri yɛ ko: «Simɔn, i ye sunɔɔ rɔ wa? I ma se tola i ɲana hali waati kelen? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ai ye to ai ɲana ka Alla matara, sa Setana ti nala ai manɛɛnna ka ai lɔ kojuu kɛla. Sika tɛ a rɔ, a lɔɔ ye ai la ai sɔnɔmɛ rɔ ka koɲuma kɛ. Kɔni wo kɛ fanka tɛ ai fari rɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Isa bɔra ii fɛ ka wa ɲɛfɛ ikɔ tuun, ka Alla matara wo ɲa kelen ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />A kɔsɛ mɛn kɛnin ii ma, a ka ii tɛrɛn sunɔɔ rɔ ikɔ tuun. Baa sunɔɔ ba tɛrɛ ii ɲa la. Ii kununnin, ii ma a lɔn ii ka kan ka mɛn fɔ Isa yɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Isa wara ka na ii tɛrɛn a siɲa sawana. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye sunɔɔla fɔlɔ ka ai ɲɔɲɔ wa? A ra ban ten. Waati ra se. Sisɛn, Mɔɔ Dencɛ kɛtɔ donna kojuukɛlailu bolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ai ye ai wuli, an ye wa. Mɛn di n don mɔɔ juuilu bolo, wo ra na.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu nara Isa mira diya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Nba, ka Isa to kumala, Judasi sera ye, wo mɛn ye Isa la talibidenba tan ni fila do ri. Jama ba tɛrɛ ye a kɔfɛ, fanmuru ni gbeleke ye ii bolo la. Ii kelayanin Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu le bolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />(Nba, mɛn kɛtɔ Isa donna ii bolo, a tun ka tɔɔmasere yiraka ii la. A ka a fɔ ko: «N wa n ton mɛn kan ka a sunbu, wo le. Ai ye a mira ka wa a ri, ka ai janto a rɔ kosɛbɛ.») <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Awa, Judasi senin ye, a ka a madon Isa la i kɔrɔ ka a fɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ!» A ka a ton a kan ka a sunbu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Wo tuma, mɔɔ doilu ka Isa mira. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Mɔɔ do ka a la fanmuru bɔ a laa rɔ ka Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba la jɔncɛ gbasi, ka a tolo kelen tɛɛ a la. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Isa ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko: «Ai nanin n mira diya gbelekeilu ni fanmuruilu ri ikomin mɔɔilu ye bɔla benkaninna kanma ɲa mɛn ma wa? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />N tɛrɛ mɔɔilu karanna ai dafɛ lon lon Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ, kɔni ai ma n mira ye. Kɔni mɛnilu sɛbɛnin Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, fɔɔ woilu bɛɛ ye kanbali. Wo le ka a kɛ, a kɛnin ten.»<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />A la karandenilu bɛɛ ka a to ye ka ii bori ka wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kanberen do bilanin tɛrɛ Isa kɔfɛ, birinkan makisali dɔrɔn bilanin a kan na. Ii ka ale mira tuma mɛn na, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />a fari makolon ka a bori ka wa, ka a la birinkan to ii bolo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ii wara Isa ri kititɛɛ dɛkuru ɲɛrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Awa, jama wara Isa ri Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba wara. Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu bɛɛ nara i ɲɔɔn nadɛn ye.<verse eid="MRK 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Piyɛri ka bila a kɔfɛ, kɔni ii tɛma ka jan, haan Sarakalasela Kuntiiba la lu ma. A ka a sii kandan mɔɔ tɔrɔfɛ ta fɛ ka ii maja. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni Judiyailu la kititɛɛla dɛkuru mɔɔilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye kuma do ɲininna Isa kanma, mɛn di se kɛla a faa sababu ri. Kɔni ii ma foyi sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Baa mɔɔ siyaman ka wuya la Isa la, kɔni ii kan ma kɛ kelen di. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Doilu ka ii lɔ ka wuya la a la ko: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«An ka a mɛn a da rɔ ko Alla batobonba mɛn lɔnin mɔɔilu bolo ɲin di, ko ale ri wo te ka dogbɛrɛ lɔ tele sawa kɔrɔ, mɛn ma lɔ mɔɔ bolo la.» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kɔni hali sereya woilu kan ma kɛ kelen di.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba wulira jama tɛma ka Isa maɲininka ko: «I tɛ an jabila foyi la? Mɔɔilu ye nfen fɔla i la ko rɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kɔni Isa ka a makun; a ma jabili kɛ. Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba ka a maɲininka ikɔ tuun ko: «Ile ye Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, i ye Alla, an ye mɛn bonyala, wo Dencɛ le ri, ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Isa ka a jabi: «Ɔɔn, nde le. Ai ri Mɔɔ Dencɛ siinin yen Sebɛɛtii Alla bolokinin ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Mansa Dawuda la Jaburi kɔndɔ suran 110 kuma diya 1 wo sɛbɛnin ye.</char></note>. Ai ri a natɔla yen duruilu tɛma ka bɔ sankolo rɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Daniyɛli kitabu kɔndɔ suran 7 kuma diya 13-14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Wo rɔ, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba ka a jɛrɛ la durukiba mira ka a rafarafara. A ka a fɔ ko: «An mako tɛ mɔɔilu la sereya la butun. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ai ra Alla tanama kuma wo mɛn a da rɔ! An ye nfen kɛla wo rɔ?» Ii bɛɛ ka a fɔ ko Isa ni saya le ka kan. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Mɔɔ doilu wulira ii daji kɛla a ma, ka a ɲa lasidi, ka a gbasi ii bolokudu la. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Mɛn ka i gbasi, wo tɔɔ fɔ an yɛ!» Kɔnɔgbɛnnailu fanan ka a mira, ka a gbasi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko a ma Isa lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Nba, ka Piyɛri to lu ma ye sankaso bon kɔrɔ, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiiba la jɔnmuso do nara. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Wo ka Piyɛri yen, a ye a majala ta da la. A ka Piyɛri ragbɛ kosɛbɛ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ile fanan tɛrɛ ye Isa kɔfɛ, Nasarɛtika jɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kɔni Piyɛri ka a sɔsɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «I ye mɛn fɔla, n ma a lɔn; n ma wo famun.» Wo kɔ rɔ, Piyɛri bɔra ye ka wa i lɔ lu da la. Dondon kasira. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Jɔnmuso kelen wo ka Piyɛri yen ye. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ikɔ tuun ye mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin ye mɔɔ woilu do le ri.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Kɔni Piyɛri ka a sɔsɔ ikɔ tuun. A ma mɛn, mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔnin tɛrɛ ye, woilu ka a fɔ Piyɛri yɛ ko: «Sika tɛ a rɔ, i fanan ye mɔɔ woilu do le ri, baa i ye Kalileka le ri.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Wo tuma, Piyɛri ka a kali ko: «Ni n ye wuya le fɔla, Alla kana n to ye. Ai ye kumala cɛɛ mɛn na ko rɔ, nde ma wo lɔn fewu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Wo waati jɛrɛ rɔ, dondon kasira a siɲa filana rɔ. Isa tun ka mɛn fɔ Piyɛri yɛ, a hankili bilara wo rɔ. Baa Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Sani dondon ye kasi siɲa fila bi, i ri a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ siɲa sawa ko i ma n lɔn.» Wo rɔ, Piyɛri kasira kosɛbɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Isa ye Pilate Ɲakɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Sɔɔma da la jonna, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ni kititɛɛ dɛkuru bɛɛ ka i ɲɔɔn yen Isa la ko rɔ. Ii ka a sidi, ka wa a don Pilate bolo. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilate ka a maɲininka ko: «Ile le Judiyailu la mansa ri wa?» Isa ka a jabi: «I jɛrɛ ra a fɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ka sɔn siyaman la Isa la. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilate ka Isa maɲininka ikɔ tuun ko: «I tɛ jabili kɛla wa? Ii ra sɔn siyaman la i la. I ma wo mɛn wa?» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kɔni Isa ma jabili si kɛ wo ko rɔ. Wo ka Pilate kabannakoya.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judiyailu ka a fɔ ko Isa ye faa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Nba, Pilate dorinin kasoden kelen bilala Taminkunna Sali waati san san, jama ye a fɛ a ye mɛn bila. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn cɛɛ do ye ye, mɛn tɔɔ ko Barabasi. A ni muruntiba tɔilu bilanin kaso la, baa ii ka mɔɔ do faa jama wuli tumana Romu faamailu kanma. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Jama senin Pilate wara, ii ka a madiya ko a ye kasoden do bila ii yɛ ikomin a dorinin a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilate ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai ye a fɛ n ye Judiyailu la mansa le bila ai yɛ wa?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilate ka a lɔn ko keleya le ka a kɛ Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ka Isa don ale bolo. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kɔni Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ka jama lasu ko ii ye Pilate madiya ko a ye Barabasi bila. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilate ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye mɛn kilila Judiyailu la mansa, ai ye a fɛ n ye nfen kɛ wo la wo rɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ii bɛɛ ka ii kan nabɔ ko: «A gbɔngbɔn jiri kan!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilate ka ii maɲininka ko: «Nfenna? A ka kojuu ɲuman de kɛ?» Kɔni ii ka do la ii la kan nabɔ kan ikɔ tuun ko: «A gbɔngbɔn jiri kan!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilate tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka jama ladiya. Wo rɔ, a ka Barabasi bila, ka ban ka mɔɔilu lɔ Isa gbasila gbiɲɛ la. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka Isa don tɛsidiilu bolo ko ii ye wa a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɛlɛdenilu ka Isa lafɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Tɛsidiilu wara Isa ri jin kɔndɔ mansabolon na, ka tɛsidi tɔilu bɛɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tɛsidi woilu tɛrɛ ri mɔɔ kɛmɛ wɔɔrɔ (600) ɲɔɔn bɔ</char></note> kili ko ii ye na. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ii ka durukiba wulenman ɲalagbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mansa duruki ye durukiba wulenman ɲalagbɛ wo ri </char></note> do bila Isa kan na, ka wɔnin dabɛn ka a kɛ mansa fula munuɲa ri ka a birin a kun na. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka a kɔndɔn damira ko: «Judiyailu la mansa, Jɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ii tora a gbasila a kun dɔ gbeleke la ka daji tu a kan. Ii ka ii ɲɔnkin a kɔrɔ ka a kɛ ikomin ii ye a bonyala le. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ii banda a lafɛyala tuma mɛn na, ii ka durukiba wulenman ɲalagbɛ bɔ a kan na, ka a jɛrɛ la faaninilu bila a kan na. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii bɔra a ri ka wa a gbɔngbɔn diya.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ii ka Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Nba, ii watɔla, ii ka cɛɛ do yen taminna, mɛn bɔtɔ waa rɔ. Cɛɛ wo tɔɔ ko Simɔn mɛn bɔnin Sirɛni. (A dencɛilu tɔɔ ko Alɛsandire ni Rufusi.) Kɛlɛdenilu ka a diyagboya ko a ye Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri ta. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ii wara Isa ri yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Kɔlikota. (Wo kɔrɔ le ko Kunkolo Yɔrɔ.) <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ii senin ye, ii ka rɛsɛnji di Isa ma, muri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muri ye jiri kasila do le ri </char></note> do ɲaaminnin mɛn na. Isa ma sɔn rɛsɛnji wo rɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ii ka Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka kɛ a la faaninilu ratalan ri i ɲɔɔn tɛma. Ii ka matɛɛli kɛ wo rɔ, sa bɛɛ ri ii ta sɔrɔnta lɔn. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ii ka Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan walaharakɔ waati le. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />A gbɔngbɔn kun sɛbɛnin walan do kan ko, «Judiyailu la Mansa.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27-28" />Ii ka benkaninna fila gbɔngbɔn a tɔrɔfɛ. Ii ka kelen gbɔngbɔn jiri do kan a bolokinin ma, ka a tɔ kelen gbɔngbɔn jiri do kan a bolomaran ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Taminbatɔilu tɛrɛ ye a naninna, ka ii kun dadɔn a kanma ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «He! Ile mɛn di se Allabatobonba tela ka a lɔ tele sawa kɔrɔ <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />i jɛrɛ kisi ka bɔ jiri kan!»<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, Alla la sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu fanan tɛrɛ ye a lafɛyala, ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «A ka doilu kisi, kɔni a ti se a jɛrɛ kisila. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ni a ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, Isirayɛlikailu la mansa kɔnin, a ye jii ka a bɔ jiri kan. Ni an ka wo yen, an di lemɛniya a ma.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Mɔɔ fila mɛn gbɔngbɔnnin Isa tɔrɔfɛ, woilu fanan tɛrɛ ye a naninna.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Nba, tele la telen waati senin, dibi donda jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ. A tora ten haan tele kɔla waati. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Wo tuma, Isa ka a kan ba labɔ ko: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lɛma sabakatani?» Wo kɔrɔ le ko: «N Maari, n Maari. Nfenna i ra i ban n dɔ?»<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔnin tɛrɛ diya wo rɔ, woilu ka wo mɛn ka a fɔ ko: «A ragbɛ, a ye Eliya le kilila.» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Do ka a bori ka wa fuu do ta, ka a sun rɛsɛnji tintiriɲanin dɔ. A ka wo dun kala la ka a la Isa da la ko a ye a min. Cɛɛ wo ka a fɔ a duɲɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai lɔ. An ye a ragbɛ, ni Eliya ri na ka a lajii ka a bɔ jiri kan.» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kɔni Isa ka kule kan ba labɔ ka sa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Alla batobonba tɛɛtɛɛ faanin farara fila ri ka bɔ san ma ka se duu ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Romu tɛsidi kuntii mɛn lɔnin tɛrɛ Isa ɲakɔrɔ ye, wo ka Isa sa ɲa yen ka a fɔ ko: «Tuɲa le, Alla Dencɛ le tɛrɛ cɛɛ ɲin di.»<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Muso doilu fanan lɔnin tɛrɛ yɔrɔ jan ka ko woilu ragbɛ. Mariyamu Makidalaka tɛrɛ ye muso woilu rɔ, a ni Yakuba dɔɔmanin ni Jose na Mariyamu, a ni Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ka Isa to Kalile mara rɔ, muso woilu bilanin tɛrɛ a kɔfɛ ka a dɛmɛn. Muso gbɛrɛ siyaman fanan lɔnin tɛrɛ ii dafɛ ye, mɛnilu nanin Isa malɔ diya Jerusalɛmu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa su don ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Nba, su kotɔ le tɛrɛ. Wo lon tɛrɛ ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ɲasii lon de ri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni tele bera, Ɲɔɲɔ Lon di bɔ. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Cɛɛ do tɛrɛ ye, mɛn tɔɔ ko Yusufu. A bɔnin Arimate so kɔndɔ. A tɛrɛ ye Judiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔ dɛkuru mɔɔba do ri. A jii tɛrɛ Alla la mansaya na waati la. Yusufu wara Pilate tɛrɛn ye jusulatɛɛ rɔ, ka a madiya ko a ye diɲɛ a ye wa Isa su lajii ka wa a don. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilate ka a mɛn, tuma mɛn na, ko Isa ra sa i kɔrɔ, a kabannakoyara. A ka tɛsidi kuntii kili ka a maɲininka ni Isa sa ra mɛn. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Tɛsidi kuntii ka a fɔ Pilate yɛ ko a ye ten de. Wo rɔ, Pilate ka Isa su don Yusufu bolo. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusufu ka gbaasa faanin do san, ka wa Isa su lajii ka a bɔ a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan. A ka su kasanke gbaasa faanin wo rɔ, ka wa a don kaburu do kɔndɔ, mɛn sennin farakolo rɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka kabakudun ba makurukuru ka a la kaburu da la ka wo datuun. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariyamu Makidalaka ni Jose na Mariyamu ka Isa su don yɔrɔ yen.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Isa wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nba, Ɲɔɲɔ Lon taminnin kɔ, Mariyamu Makidalaka ni Salome a ni Yakuba na Mariyamu ka tulu sumaduman san ko ii watɔ wo kɛla Isa su kan. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Lahadi lon sɔɔma da la jonna, tele bɔ tumana, muso woilu ka sila mira ka wa kaburu dala. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ii tun ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Yon di kabakudun ba makurukuru ka a bɔ kaburu da la?»<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kɔni ii ka kaburu ragbɛ tuma mɛn na, ii ka a yen ko kabakudun belebele ba, wo ra makurukuru ka bɔ kaburu da la. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ii donnin kaburu kɔndɔ, ii ka kanberen do siinin yen ii bolokinin fan fɛ. Durukiba gbɛman ye a kan na. Ii silanda kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kanberen wo ka a fɔ ko: «Ai kana silan. Ai ye Isa Nasarɛtika le ɲininna, mɛn gbɔngbɔnnin tɛrɛ jiri kan. A ra wuli! A tɛ yan. Ii ka a su la yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, ai ye wo ragbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ai ye wa a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ a ni Piyɛri fanan yɛ ko a watɔ ai ɲɛrɔ Kalile. Ai ri a yen ye ikomin a ka a fɔ ai yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Nba, musoilu bɔra kaburu kɔndɔ ka ii bori ka wa. Ii yɛrɛyɛrɛnin, ii kɔndafilinin kojuuya. Ii ma foyi fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ baa ii silannin.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Mariyamu Makidalaka la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">16.9 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛn sɛbɛnin yan haan kuma diya 20, wo te sɛbɛ sɛbɛli fɔlɔilu kɔndɔ.</char>
    </note>[Isa wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ lahadi lon sɔɔma da la jonna. A wulinin kɔ, a ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Mariyamu Makidalaka le fɔlɔ la, a tun ka jena wɔrɔnwula gbɛn ka a bɔ wo mɛn fɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mariyamu wo le wara kibaro wo bɛɛ fɔ Isa kɔmɔɔilu yɛ. A ka ii jusumakasanin tɛrɛn ye. Ii ye kasila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ii ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Isa kɛndɛ, ko Mariyamu ka a yen, ii ma la wo la fewu.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka a la karandenilu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ka Isa la karanden fila to taamanna waa rɔ, Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka ii la ɲa su gbɛrɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Mɔɔ fila wo bɔra ye ka na wo kibaro fɔ karanden tɔilu yɛ. Kɔni woilu ma la ii fanan na.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ka talibidenba tan ni kelen to dɔɔnninna, Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka ii la. A ka ii jalaki ka a masɔrɔn ii tun ma lemɛniya, a ni ii kun janin tɛrɛ fanan. Baa mɛnilu ka a ɲenema yen a wuli kɔ ka bɔ saya rɔ, ii ma la woilu la kuma la. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa dunuɲa fan bɛɛ rɔ ka kibaro ɲuma lase mɔɔilu bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ni mɔɔ mɛn lemɛniyara a ma ka sun ji rɔ, wo tii ri kisi. Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn ma lemɛniya a ma, Alla la kiti ri be wo tii kan. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri tɔɔmasere mɛnilu yiraka, woilu le ɲin di: ii ri jenailu gbɛn ka bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ n tɔɔ rɔ. Ii ri kuma kan gbɛrɛilu rɔ, ii tun ma mɛnilu lɔn kɔrɔman. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Ii ri saailu mira ii bolo la. Ni ii ka dabaari min, a ti nala foyi kɛla ii la. Ii wa ii bolo la jankarɔtɔilu kan, jankarɔtɔilu ri kɛndɛya.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Maari Isa banda wo fɔla ii yɛ tuma mɛn na, a kɔrɔtara ka wa sankolo rɔ, ka wa a sii Alla bolokinin ma.<verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Karandenilu bɔra ye kawandili kanma yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. Maari ka ii dɛmɛn baara wo la, ka tɔɔmasereilu kɛ, mɛnilu ka a yiraka ko kuma wo ye tuɲa le ri.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>